window.__T__=[{"i":19000,"text":"to image:\nA single breathtaking cinematic keyframe of a Yin-Yang symbol seamlessly merging with the Tree of Life. The Yin-Yang is crafted from flowing liquid gold and polished obsidian, its black and white halves adorned with intricate swirling filigree and sacred geometric accents. From the central curve, dark jade roots extend gracefully downward while radiant golden branches bloom upward, forming a harmonious Tree of Life that embraces the symbol. Luminous energy flows along the branches like liquid starlight. The background is a dreamy, ethereal cosmic atmosphere with soft volumetric clouds, floating golden embers, and distant starlight. Style: photorealistic 8K resolution, ultra-detailed luxury aesthetic, macro focus on metallic and glass textures, cinematic chiaroscuro lighting, rich gold/deep black/pearl white palette, intricate fractal details, centered composition, shallow depth of field. Masterpiece, digital painting meets hyperrealism, mystical and meditative mood. NO text, NO borders, NO grid, NO UI.\n\n🎥Prompt to video ⤵️","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2098057609031139328/img/wojrlCv8iHVwRHwd.jpg"]},{"i":19001,"text":"写三百字也说不清。\n人物究竟站在哪里，产品应该占多大，镜头朝向哪里都无法精确描述。\n而ChatGPT Images 2.5 新增的 Sketch 功能提供了一个直接办法。\n输入 @Sketch，用方框、线条和箭头画出结构，再让AI完成主体、场景、材质与光线。\n草图决定画面怎么放，文字决定画面是什么。\n下面我来分享下这个做法：\n\n🎯 核心提示词\n\n打开 ChatGPT Images，输入 @Sketch，绘制一张3比4竖版构图草图。\n\n使用简单图形标记画面结构。\n\nA区域代表【人物或产品】\nB区域代表【前景物体】\nC区域代表【背景建筑或环境】\n箭头代表【人物视线、动作或镜头方向】\n虚线区域作为【标题或留白安全区】\n\n完成草图后输入以下提示词。\n\n将这张草图转化为一张【海报、产品广告、电影关键帧、室内效果图或出版插图】。\n\n严格继承草图中的主体数量、位置、画面占比、朝向、前后遮挡、地平线、视觉中心和留白区域。\n\n将A区域替换为【主体设定】，正在【具体动作】。\n将B区域替换为【前景内容】，形成自然遮挡。\n将C区域替换为【场景设定】，符合统一透视与空间尺度。\n\n采用【写实摄影、手绘插画、编辑设计或电影质感】。光线来自【方向】，主色为【颜色】，材质表现【具体要求】。\n\n草图中的方框、箭头、字母和辅助线只用于控制构图，成片中全部删除。\n\n禁止自动居中、改变主体数量、交换前后关系、填满留白、增加分栏、生成过程图和保留草图标记。\n\n输出一张独立的3比4成品图。\n\n💡 核心逻辑\n\n草图直控包含三部分。\n\n几何图形控制位置与比例。\n箭头控制动作、视线和方向。\n文字补充身份、材质、场景与光线。\n\n绘画能力不会决定结果。结构表达是否清楚，才会影响成片。\n\n🔁 延伸玩法\n\n• 规划电影分镜与人物走位\n• 控制产品广告的主体比例\n• 设计海报标题与视觉留白\n• 还原室内家具布局\n• 制作图书插图与信息图\n• 指定多人物的位置关系\n• 为参考图补画前景和背景\n• 设计短视频的起始关键帧\n\n⚙️ 关键控制点\n\n草图只画结构，不画纹理和复杂细节。\n\n主体高度、地平线和留白可以直接标注比例。涉及多人时，用A、B、C区分身份，避免位置互换。\n\n标注文字可能进入成片。提示词需要明确删除全部字母、箭头和辅助线。\n\n第一轮先检查位置、比例和遮挡。构图通过以后，再用局部评论修改服装、颜色、材质和细节。\n\n📌 一句话总结\n\n草图直控，是先用线条规定画面结构，再让文字完成视觉内容。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HR5shwra8AAlV_p.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HR5shvxbgAAk_ww.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HR5shxQaEAAWM9j.jpg"]},{"i":19002,"text":"Create a highly realistic professional beauty portrait using the provided reference image.\nSTRICT IDENTITY & FACE LOCK:\nPreserve the exact facial identity, facial proportions, natural features, nose, lips, eyes, eyebrows, jawline, skin texture, and overall appearance from the reference image. Do not beautify, reshape, or alter the face. Keep the same natural expression and realistic anatomy.\nHAIR:\nKeep the exact same hairstyle, hair length, hair color, hair texture, center parting, and loose strands as shown in the reference.\nCLOTHING:\nReplace the black top with a clean, elegant sleeveless top in a PURE HONEY color — warm golden honey / soft amber-gold tone. The fabric should look premium, natural, and realistic with subtle texture. Keep the same neckline, sleeveless cut, fit, and overall clothing shape as the reference. No patterns, logos, prints, or accessories.\n\nPOSE & COMPOSITION:\nMaintain the same three-angle beauty reference composition:\n\n1. Front/three-quarter close-up portrait at the top.\n\n2. Left-side profile portrait at the bottom left.\n\n3. Three-quarter portrait facing slightly right at the bottom right.\n\nKeep the same framing, head position, shoulder placement, camera perspective, and neutral studio background.\n\nLIGHTING & REALISM:\nSoft natural studio lighting, realistic skin pores and texture, subtle natural imperfections, authentic hair strands, accurate facial anatomy, gentle shadows, realistic DSLR photography, high-end professional beauty portfolio quality.\n\nCOLOR:\nThe clothing must be clearly PURE HONEY / GOLDEN HONEY, not yellow, orange, beige, brown, or mustard.\n\nNEGATIVE PROMPT:\nDo not change facial identity, face shape, eyes, nose, lips, eyebrows, hairstyle, skin tone, age, expression, body proportions, or pose. No excessive makeup, plastic skin, beauty filter, face distortion, extra accessories, jewelry, patterns, logos, text, or artificial-looking skin.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HR71gh_boAAp-0B.jpg"]},{"i":19003,"text":"上传图1作为产品身份的唯一参考，制作一段12秒、16∶9的产品广告。\n\n第一步｜生成广告风格帧\n\n严格保留产品的外形比例、包装结构、Logo位置、标签文字、材质和颜色。\n\n将产品放入【冰面、黑色镜面、液态金属、东方园林或极简影棚】。产品占画面高度的40％至55％，保留展示空间和摄影机移动空间。\n\n采用【指定光线与色彩】，建立产品主视觉。输出一张独立风格帧，不生成分镜板和多角度展示图。\n\n第二步｜制作运动预演\n\n根据风格帧在Blender中建立低精度白模。只复原产品外轮廓、承托平面、主要障碍物和摄影机位置。\n\n设置一项主要产品动作【旋转、开合、升起、组装或穿越液体】，配合一次【推近、横移或低位抬升】。\n\n在第0、3、7和12秒设置关键姿态，输出12秒白模预演视频。不要在这一阶段制作精细材质。\n\n第三步｜完成视频渲染\n\n将图1设为产品身份参考，将风格帧设为场景、构图、材质和光线参考，将Blender预演视频设为动作、速度、时间和摄影机参考。\n\n生成12秒单一连续镜头。产品严格按照预演轨迹运动，保持图1中的外形、文字和结构。延续风格帧的背景、色彩、反射和投影。\n\n加入真实接触阴影、材质高光变化、运动模糊和环境反馈。产品经过水面时产生涟漪，接触地面时产生阴影变化，部件打开时保持连接结构。\n\n禁止产品变形、Logo漂移、包装文字变化、部件增减、悬浮穿模、运动方向改变、摄影机绕至背面、场景跳变和无关特效。\n\n💡 核心逻辑\n\n单张产品图缺少运动信息。\n\n风格帧确定最终画面，Blender预演补充空间与时间，视频模型负责材质渲染和运动细节。\n\n三类参考各管一件事，可以减少产品外形和镜头运动互相干扰。\n\n🔁 延伸玩法\n\n• 香水瓶升起与液体扩散\n• 鞋履旋转与材质特写\n• 家电拆解与自动组装\n• 玩具包装变成角色舞台\n• 珠宝从原石中显现\n• 食品包装进入原料世界\n• 非遗器物完成结构展开\n• 同一产品生成横版与竖版广告\n\n📌 一句话总结\n\n单图动效成片，是用一张产品照锁住商品，再用风格帧和白模动画补齐广告所需的画面与运动。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HR_kpmgbEAA4hKX.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HR_kpmdbAAAHx_C.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HR_kpmiaIAA6S1i.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HR_kpmoagAAEhAH.jpg"]},{"i":19004,"text":"Here’s a stronger Kling-ready 15-second version, with a soothing music direction and a more cinematic progression:\nCreate a 15-second cinematic film sequence of a young man walking slowly through a modern city at night. Light rain falls continuously, creating reflections of glowing streetlights, colorful neon signs, storefronts, and passing cars across the wet pavement.\n0–5 seconds: Start with a wide cinematic shot from behind as the young man walks calmly down the rain-soaked street. His clothes and hair move naturally with the light breeze. Neon lights softly illuminate the surroundings.\n5–10 seconds: The camera smoothly moves alongside him in a slow tracking shot. He briefly looks toward the glowing city lights while rain droplets pass naturally in front of the lens. Background pedestrians and vehicles move realistically, slightly blurred.\n10–15 seconds: The camera slowly moves toward a front three-quarter close-up of his face. He continues walking with a peaceful, thoughtful expression while colorful city lights create beautiful soft bokeh behind him. End with a gentle cinematic push-in.\nRealistic human walking motion, natural body movement, realistic rain physics, wet pavement reflections, soft volumetric lighting, subtle atmospheric haze, shallow depth of field, realistic skin and clothing textures, smooth stabilized camera movement, cinematic 35mm lens, subtle film grain, high dynamic range, photorealistic 4K cinematic movie quality.\nAudio: Add soothing, relaxing cinematic background music throughout the entire sequence — soft ambient piano with gentle atmospheric pads, subtle rain ambience and distant city sounds. Music should feel peaceful, emotional and slightly nostalgic, remain low and unobtrusive, and smoothly build toward the final close-up. No vocals, no dialogue, no sudden beats, no dramatic music.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2098780287425810432/img/dImFOVVIkrGP_8ti.jpg"]},{"i":19005,"text":"（发给MiniMax Design或者Astra，调用Agent生成）：\n\n连接当前After Effects项目，读取已经导入的Logo、产品图、标题和品牌色。\n\n先检查素材名称、分辨率、帧率、透明通道和缺失文件。保留原项目，新建一个独立合成。\n\n合成名称设为PRODUCT_MOTION_V01，尺寸1920×1080，25帧每秒，时长10秒。\n\n建立以下图层结构。\n\n背景BG\n\n产品PRODUCT\n\n品牌标志LOGO\n\n主标题TITLE\n\n辅助文字SUBTITLE\n\n装饰元素ACCENT\n\n统一控制器CTRL\n\n主标题只使用【填写标题】，辅助文字只使用【填写文字】。保持品牌字体、Logo比例和产品外形，不替换文字，不重新设计Logo。\n\n0至2秒建立背景和产品轮廓。产品从画面下方进入，位置与缩放形成一次缓冲。\n\n2至5秒展示产品主体。摄影机沿Z轴推近，产品旋转15度，材质高光从左向右移动。\n\n5至8秒出现主标题和辅助文字。文字按行进入，保持阅读顺序，每行动画间隔4帧。\n\n8至10秒完成Logo落版。产品停止运动，标题、Logo和行动信息同时保持清晰。\n\n位置、缩放和透明度使用关键帧控制。应用缓入缓出、运动模糊和图表曲线。重复摆动、延迟和统一颜色可以使用表达式。\n\n所有图层按照功能命名，相关元素放入预合成。删除空图层和未使用素材，修复无效表达式。保存为新版本，不覆盖原项目，不预渲染成扁平视频。\n\n💡 核心逻辑\n\n可编辑动效工程保留四类控制。\n\n图层负责拆分素材。\n\n关键帧负责时间与节奏。\n\n表达式负责重复关系。\n\n版本副本负责保留原项目。\n\n客户提出修改时，设计师可以找到对应图层直接处理。\n\n🔁 延伸玩法\n\n• Logo出现与品牌片头\n\n• 产品发布会倒计时\n\n• 动态海报与文字排版\n\n• App界面功能演示\n\n• 数据图表动态展示\n\n• 横版广告转竖版短视频\n\n• 多语言标题批量替换\n\n• 同一工程生成多套配色\n\n📌 一句话总结\n\n可编辑视频，是让AI交付一套能被设计师继续修改的After Effects项目。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSGPBXOakAAE3NQ.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSGPBXTaUAA0T9Y.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSGPBatbAAA2LiU.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2099116082779054080/img/xkhuIRZUe3w1od1G.jpg"]},{"i":19006,"text":"15-second cinematic continuous shot, ultra-realistic, natural film look, 24fps.\n0–4 seconds: Extreme close-up of a sunlit animal skull lying partially buried in dry golden grass. Small yellow and blue wildflowers are naturally growing through the skull, clearly visible and unchanged. Warm early-morning sunlight illuminates the bone and surrounding grass. Shallow depth of field, realistic textures, soft background bokeh. The grass gently moves in a light natural breeze.\n4–7 seconds: A woman’s leg wearing brown suede boots enters the frame and naturally steps over the skull without touching or disturbing it. Her other foot follows as she continues walking forward along the forest path. Keep the skull, flowers, dry grass, and boots clearly realistic and consistent.\n7–11 seconds: As she moves farther away, the camera slowly rises upward and smoothly follows behind her, transitioning from the ground-level close-up into a medium rear shot. Reveal a blonde woman with long flowing hair, wearing a dark navy-blue cloak that moves naturally with her walking motion and the gentle breeze.\n11–15 seconds: The camera continues smoothly following her from behind as she walks deeper along the forest path. Tall trees surround the path, with warm sun rays filtering naturally through the branches. In the distance, mountains glow softly in golden morning light, creating atmospheric depth. Her long blonde hair and navy-blue cloak move naturally as she walks. End with a beautiful cinematic rear composition of the woman disappearing deeper into the forest.\nVisual direction: photorealistic, cinematic natural lighting, warm golden morning atmosphere, realistic forest textures, physically accurate shadows, subtle atmospheric haze, realistic human walking motion, smooth camera movement, shallow depth of field transitioning naturally into deeper environmental focus, no artificial effects, no cuts, no sudden camera movements, seamless continuous shot, premium cinematic film quality.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2099138035061555201/img/trprjjnfYkjPP6wl.jpg"]},{"i":19007,"text":"请将我上传的照片制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不要多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。\n\n整体为3:4竖版构图，画面严格分为上下两个区域，高度各占50%，比例为1:1。\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体身份、结构、姿态、真实质感、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级调色，使其具有艺术杂志、独立出版物与展览图像质感。为适配画幅，可以自然补足环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分基于同一张照片，提取其中最具识别性的主体、轮廓、结构、姿态与叙事关系，重构为现代主义几何平涂插画。\n\n插画要求：\n不是用几何线条描边，而是直接将主体压缩为矩形、梯形、三角形、圆形及少量自由块面，用最少形状保留最关键的身份特征，使人一眼能够认出原物。\n\n整体采用明显的平面化空间表达：\n弱化真实透视、体积和写实光影，主要通过前后遮挡、尺度变化、色块叠压与高低关系建立空间。\n\n复杂的人物、建筑、车辆、植物、器物或环境细节要主动合并为少数大形体系统，重复元素归纳为统一色块，不逐一描绘。\n\n若原图不是城市场景，不要强行城市化，而是用同样的几何化方法重构人物、动物、静物、自然景观或其他主体。\n\n构图强调：\n大块面比例、视觉重心、层叠关系、正负形、色彩节奏与留白秩序。主体可以偏心、裁切、遮挡或自然展开，但必须保持清楚的叙事核心。\n\n造型采用：\n大面积平涂色块，轻微手绘不规则边缘，哑光水粉或丙烯质感。颜料表面细腻、柔和，略有手工覆盖感。避免数字渐变、真实材质模拟、复杂阴影、照片滤镜和光滑矢量感。\n\n最终效果：\n上半部分像高级摄影海报，下半部分像现代主义几何拼贴插画，两者对应同一主体，形成清晰的上下对照关系。\n\n这类提示词的核心公式是：\n\n真实照片保留 + 下半几何重构 + 平面化空间 + 大色块概括 + 上下对照成海报。\n\n📌 一句话总结\n\n上下双生海报的高级感，不在于把照片做得多花，而在于让同一张图同时完成“真实记录”和“几何重构”两层表达。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSJGsFPaIAAh1Dd.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSJG1PjbIAE3vAp.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSJG1PjawAA4H0G.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSJG1PkbMAAJB2s.jpg"]},{"i":19008,"text":"请基于上传的照片，制作一张3:4竖版“昼夜暮光双生”高级设计海报。\n\n整体上下分为两个区域，高度严格各占50%，形成清晰的上下双生结构。\n\n【上半部分】\n\n完整保留原始照片。\n\n保持主体人物 / 产品 / 建筑的身份、姿态、服装、结构、构图、镜头视角、环境关系、自然光影和原有色彩氛围。\n\n仅进行轻微高级调色，使画面更接近艺术杂志、独立出版物和展览摄影质感。\n\n不要改变主体，不要重新摆姿势，不要重构场景。\n\n为适配画幅，可自然扩展环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体比例。\n\n【下半部分】\n\n严格保持与上半部分：\n同一主体\n同一姿态\n同一构图\n同一镜头角度\n同一环境结构\n同一叙事关系\n\n只改变时间、光线、色温与空气状态。\n\n将同一场景重构为“蓝调暮色 / 夜幕初临”的电影摄影版本。\n\n环境整体转换为深蓝、蓝灰、冷紫灰色调。\n\n天空进入日落结束后的蓝调时刻，环境亮度下降，但仍保留足够细节。\n\n人物或主体保持真实摄影质感。\n\n加入自然的夜间直闪或轻微正面补光，让人物脸部、产品表面或建筑主体依然清晰。\n\n主体边缘可出现少量暖色轮廓光，与冷蓝环境形成冷暖对比。\n\n高光允许轻微溢出，保留真实皮肤纹理、发丝、衣料、金属、玻璃和环境细节。\n\n加入轻微胶片颗粒、低照度空气感、柔和光晕、远处灯光散景和真实环境反射。\n\n如果原图中存在路面、玻璃、水面或金属表面，可以自然增加夜间灯光反射，但不得改变原有结构。\n\n上下两部分必须一眼看出是同一个地点、同一个人物、同一个瞬间的时间转换。\n\n整体效果像摄影杂志中的“昼夜对照实验”：\n真实、克制、有电影感、有时间变化，但不过度特效化。\n\n避免：\n更换人物\n改变服装\n改变姿态\n重新生成不同场景\n赛博朋克霓虹\n极端紫蓝色\n纯黑夜景\n卡通化\n塑料皮肤\n过度光晕\n复杂特效\n\n这套提示词最重要的一句是：\n\n“同一主体、同一姿态、同一构图、同一环境，只改变时间与光线。”\n\n只要这句锁住，双生关系才成立。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSOb4_Ma4AEh0mr.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSOb8vzbsAA7hRV.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSOb8q9bsAAqXWv.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSOb8q8bQAAUaGb.jpg"]},{"i":19009,"text":"image_generation\": {\n\"face\": {\n\"preserve_original\": true,\n\"reference_match\": true,\n\"description\": \"Maintain the same facial structure, skin tone, eye shape, and natural expressions across all frames, with consistent identity in each pose.\"\n},\n\n\"photo_style\": {\n\"type\": \"golden hour portrait collage\",\n\"camera_angle\": \"varied close-up and medium portrait angles\",\n\"lighting\": \"warm golden hour sunlight casting soft window shadows\",\n\"mood\": \"soft, calm, intimate, aesthetic\",\n\"texture\": \"natural skin texture, soft highlights, gentle contrast\",\n\"focus\": \"sharp focus on face with smooth background falloff\"\n},\n\n\"subject\": {\n\"poses\": [\n\"looking upward toward light\",\n\"soft smile facing camera\",\n\"side profile with downward gaze\",\n\"over-the-shoulder glance\",\n\"direct close-up with relaxed lips\",\n\"hand in hair casual pose\",\n\"head tilted back toward light\",\n\"clean side profile portrait\",\n\"thoughtful pose with hand near chin\"\n],\n\"expression\": \"natural, minimal, relaxed, emotionally subtle\",\n\"hair\": {\n\"style\": \"long straight hair worn loose\",\n\"color\": \"light to medium brown\",\n\"details\": \"natural shine with soft light highlights\"\n},\n\"clothing\": {\n\"type\": \"casual minimalist outfit\",\n\"details\": \"simple dark t-shirt with no visible branding\"\n}\n},\n\n\"composition\": {\n\"layout\": \"3x3 grid collage\",\n\"consistency\": \"uniform lighting and background across all frames\",\n\"framing\": \"clean portrait framing with slight pose variation\"\n},\n\n\"environment\": {\n\"setting\": \"indoor space near a window\",\n\"background\": \"plain wall with warm sunlight and shadow patterns\",\n\"atmosphere\": \"quiet, minimal, artistic indoor ambiance\"\n},\n\n\"aesthetic\": {\n\"style\": \"Instagram aesthetic portrait set\",\n\"features\": [\n\"golden hour light\",\n\"window shadow patterns\",\n\"minimal makeup\",\n\"natural expressions\",\n\"clean editorial portrait look\"\n]\n}\n\n}\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSPAzm0aYAAEg4W.jpg"]},{"i":19010,"text":"Create a hyper-realistic, cinematic portrait of me (use uploaded face) as a modern mafia boss. I’m sitting in a luxury black car, wearing a black suit and tinted aviator sunglasses, smoking a thick cigar. Cold, fearless expression. Background: moody sky + blurred city/street for noir feel. Cool tones, high contrast. Sharp details on face & smoke. Style: 8K, movie-poster quality, shallow depth of field 1:1","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSPLINDbUAAicdA.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSPLIwSagAAbdD0.jpg"]},{"i":19011,"text":"{\n  \"input\": {\n    \"city_name\": \"{{USER_INPUT_CITY}}\"\n  },\n\n  \"reference_style\": {\n    \"use_uploaded_reference_images\": true,\n    \"reference_images_define\": [\n      \"overall composition\",\n      \"hand-cut screenprint aesthetic\",\n      \"bold black graphic silhouettes\",\n      \"limited color palette\",\n      \"vintage travel poster character\",\n      \"rough ink texture\",\n      \"slightly imperfect handmade edges\",\n      \"large oversized city typography\",\n      \"layered landmark arrangement\",\n      \"bottom transportation element\",\n      \"cream/off-white paper background\",\n      \"minimal editorial composition\"\n    ],\n    \"do_not_copy\": [\n      \"specific landmarks\",\n      \"specific city name\",\n      \"specific vehicle\",\n      \"specific color combinations\",\n      \"exact typography arrangement\",\n      \"exact landmark placement\"\n    ]\n  },\n\n  \"generation\": {\n    \"type\": \"vintage_city_travel_poster\",\n    \"aspect_ratio\": \"3:4\",\n    \"resolution\": \"high\",\n    \"orientation\": \"portrait\",\n\n    \"city_adaptation\": {\n      \"primary_rule\": \"Everything must be redesigned around the user's city_name.\",\n      \"identify_city\": true,\n      \"research_visual_identity\": true,\n\n      \"landmarks\": {\n        \"count\": \"4-7\",\n        \"selection\": \"Automatically select the most recognizable and visually distinctive landmarks of the specified city.\",\n        \"prioritize\": [\n          \"major landmark\",\n          \"historic architecture\",\n          \"modern architectural icon\",\n          \"religious or cultural landmark\",\n          \"bridge or monument\",\n          \"recognizable skyline element\"\n        ],\n        \"rendering\": \"Convert each landmark into simplified bold black screenprint silhouettes while preserving its recognizable architectural identity.\"\n      },\n\n      \"transportation\": {\n        \"automatically_select\": true,\n        \"instruction\": \"Choose a transportation vehicle strongly associated with the specified city, such as a taxi, tram, bus, metro train, tuk-tuk, cable car, rickshaw, classic car, ferry, or other iconic local transport.\",\n        \"placement\": \"large foreground element along the bottom edge\",\n        \"style\": \"simplified vintage screenprint illustration\"\n      },\n\n      \"colors\": {\n        \"automatically_adapt\": true,\n        \"instruction\": \"Select a restrained 2-4 color palette inspired by the city's visual identity, local transportation, flag, architecture, or cultural colors.\",\n        \"black\": \"dominant graphic ink color\",\n        \"background\": \"warm aged cream paper\",\n        \"accent_colors\": \"city-specific and muted, never overly saturated\"\n      },\n\n      \"typography\": {\n        \"text\": \"{{USER_INPUT_CITY}}\",\n        \"case\": \"uppercase\",\n        \"style\": \"large bold irregular condensed display lettering\",\n        \"placement\": \"integrated prominently between or behind the landmarks\",\n        \"texture\": \"rough printed ink\",\n        \"alignment\": \"slightly imperfect and organic\",\n        \"rule\": \"The city name must be perfectly spelled and clearly readable.\"\n      },\n\n      \"secondary_text\": {\n        \"enabled\": false,\n        \"instruction\": \"Do not add arbitrary slogans, dates, tourist phrases, descriptions, or extra readable text.\"\n      },\n\n      \"local_details\": {\n        \"automatically_adapt\": true,\n        \"instruction\": \"Add subtle visual details that immediately reinforce the identity of the specified city without overcrowding the composition.\"\n      }\n    },\n\n    \"composition\": {\n      \"layout\": \"editorial vintage travel poster\",\n      \"landmarks\": \"arranged dynamically around the typography\",\n      \"typography\": \"large central visual anchor\",\n      \"foreground\": \"one iconic city transportation element\",\n      \"depth\": \"flat graphic layering with minimal overlap\",\n      \"negative_space\": \"generous cream-colored negative space\",\n      \"balance\": \"asymmetrical but visually balanced\",\n      \"cropping\": \"allow selected landmarks or transportation to naturally extend toward the edges\"\n    },\n\n    \"art_direction\": {\n      \"medium\": \"hand-pulled screenprint / linocut-inspired travel poster\",\n      \"visual_language\": [\n        \"bold silhouettes\",\n        \"flat shapes\",\n        \"rough ink edges\",\n        \"visible print grain\",\n        \"subtle ink distress\",\n        \"slight registration imperfections\",\n        \"handmade imperfections\",\n        \"graphic editorial design\",\n        \"mid-century travel poster influence\"\n      ],\n      \"linework\": \"strong, chunky and simplified\",\n      \"texture\": \"authentic paper grain and uneven ink coverage\",\n      \"finish\": \"physical printed artwork rather than digitally perfect vector art\"\n    },\n\n    \"background\": {\n      \"color\": \"warm ivory / aged cream\",\n      \"texture\": \"subtle natural paper fibers\",\n      \"pattern\": \"none\",\n      \"gradient\": false\n    },\n\n    \"quality\": {\n      \"photorealism\": false,\n      \"vector_perfection\": false,\n      \"digital_gloss\": false,\n      \"clean_modern_ui\": false,\n      \"high_detail\": true,\n      \"print_ready_appearance\": true\n    }\n  },\n\n  \"constraints\": {\n    \"user_controls_only\": [\n      \"city_name\"\n    ],\n    \"model_controls\": [\n      \"landmark selection\",\n      \"landmark arrangement\",\n      \"transportation\",\n      \"color palette\",\n      \"local visual details\",\n      \"typographic composition\",\n      \"graphic hierarchy\"\n    ],\n    \"must_have\": [\n      \"correct city name\",\n      \"recognizable landmarks from that city\",\n      \"city-specific transportation or mobility element\",\n      \"warm cream paper background\",\n      \"bold black screenprint forms\",\n      \"large city typography\",\n      \"vintage handmade print texture\",\n      \"cohesive travel-poster composition\"\n    ],\n    \"avoid\": [\n      \"landmarks from other cities\",\n      \"generic buildings\",\n      \"generic tourist imagery\",\n      \"photorealistic rendering\",\n      \"3D rendering\",\n      \"glossy gradients\",\n      \"neon colors\",\n      \"modern corporate poster design\",\n      \"random text\",\n      \"misspelled city name\",\n      \"extra slogans\",\n      \"watermarks\",\n      \"logos\",\n      \"AI artifacts\",\n      \"overly clean vector edges\"\n    ]\n  },\n\n  \"output_instruction\": \"Create a single finished vintage screenprint travel poster representing {{USER_INPUT_CITY}}. Preserve the artistic language and visual restraint of the supplied references, but completely redesign the landmarks, transportation, color accents and local details so they authentically belong to the specified city.\"\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSPWNKrbkAAoYWC.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSPWNKhbUAAdOz6.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSPWXmrawAEEK_w.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSPWXrWa0AAIXLU.jpg"]},{"i":19012,"text":"Vertical 2:3 ultra-photorealistic luxury fashion campaign photograph.\n\nCreate a completely original high-end fashion campaign that feels like the debut visual identity of an experimental luxury fashion house.\n\nThe scene should combine architectural sculpture, fashion photography, hidden portrait art, shallow reflective water, and warm cinematic sunlight.\n\nThe result should feel expensive, artistic, mysterious, sophisticated, and highly original.\n\nIt should look like a real professionally photographed luxury campaign rather than digital artwork.\n\nMAIN SUBJECT:\n\nA beautiful young adult woman stands as the clear hero of the composition.\n\nPlace her in the lower-middle foreground surrounded by enormous sculptural architectural forms.\n\nShe should remain large enough for her face, outfit, and body language to be clearly readable.\n\nHer natural proportions must remain realistic.\n\nShe should feel physically present inside the environment rather than composited into it.\n\nHAIR:\n\nLong dark-brown hair with naturally rich volume.\n\nCreate a soft center-to-slightly-off-center part.\n\nHair falls freely past the shoulders toward the lower chest.\n\nThe texture is naturally wavy with loose irregular bends rather than defined curls.\n\nCreate soft volume around the crown and sides.\n\nSeveral front strands naturally frame the face.\n\nMore hair volume falls over one shoulder while the remaining hair flows naturally behind the other shoulder.\n\nInclude delicate wispy strands around the forehead and cheeks.\n\nAdd subtle natural flyaways.\n\nIndividual strands should be visible in the sunlight.\n\nHair should have realistic dimensional texture and restrained natural shine.\n\nThe hairstyle should feel effortless and lightly moved by the outdoor air.\n\nNo ponytail.\nNo braid.\nNo tight curls.\nNo perfectly straight hair.\nNo heavily styled salon hairstyle.\nNo artificial plastic-looking hair.\n\nOUTFIT:\n\nCreate a completely new luxury outfit inspired by quiet contemporary fashion.\n\nDress the woman in a long dusty-rose blush tailored coat made from premium soft wool-cashmere fabric.\n\nThe coat should have a relaxed elongated silhouette reaching below the knees.\n\nCreate wide sculptural lapels.\n\nSlightly oversized shoulders.\n\nLong sleeves with soft gathered cuffs.\n\nSubtle structured tailoring through the upper body.\n\nThe coat should remain open naturally.\n\nUnderneath, she wears a clean ivory square-neck silk-blend top with a minimal elegant silhouette.\n\nPair it with high-waisted wide-leg cream trousers.\n\nThe trousers should have a sophisticated tailored construction with a clean waistband, subtle front pleats, smooth flowing fabric, and natural weight.\n\nThe trouser legs should extend almost to the floor while remaining clearly separated from the shoes.\n\nComplete the outfit with minimalist ivory leather low-profile sneakers.\n\nThe overall styling should feel like contemporary luxury resort tailoring.\n\nNo denim.\nNo sweater.\nNo dress.\nNo skirt.\nNo casual streetwear.\nNo logos on clothing.\n\nACCESSORIES:\n\nAdd a small structured ivory leather shoulder bag.\n\nThe bag hangs naturally beside the woman's hip.\n\nMinimal antique-gold hardware.\n\nAdd small delicate gold hoop earrings.\n\nAdd one extremely thin gold bracelet.\n\nAdd a refined minimalist wristwatch with a small neutral dial.\n\nAccessories should remain understated and secondary to the fashion silhouette.\n\nNo oversized jewelry.\nNo flashy diamonds.\nNo visible brand logos.\nNo excessive accessories.\n\nMAKEUP & FACE:\n\nKeep the reference woman's facial identity completely intact.\n\nNatural luxury editorial makeup.\n\nFresh realistic skin with visible natural pores.\n\nSoft warm complexion.\n\nVery subtle satin skin finish.\n\nLightly defined eyebrows.\n\nNatural lashes.\n\nSoft neutral taupe eyeshadow.\n\nVery subtle brown eyeliner close to the lash line.\n\nMuted rosy-nude lips.\n\nSoft natural blush across the cheeks.\n\nNo heavy contouring.\n\nNo exaggerated eyelashes.\n\nNo glossy artificial skin.\n\nNo dramatic makeup transformation.\n\nThe face should remain realistic and recognizable.\n\nPOSE:\n\nThe woman stands naturally on a polished stone walkway.\n\nHer torso remains relaxed and upright.\n\nHer body is slightly angled rather than perfectly square to the camera.\n\nHer head turns gently toward the left side of the frame.\n\nShe looks slightly away from the camera with a calm thoughtful expression.\n\nHer expression is soft, confident, peaceful, and sophisticated.\n\nBoth hands rest naturally inside the side pockets of her long coat.\n\nHer elbows remain relaxed.\n\nOne leg is positioned slightly forward.\n\nThe other leg remains naturally behind it.\n\nCreate a subtle elegant overlap between the legs without an exaggerated crossed-leg pose.\n\nHer posture should feel candid and effortless.\n\nShe should look like she has paused naturally while walking through the architectural installation.\n\nDo not make the pose stiff.\n\nDo not make her look like a mannequin.\n\nDo not create a runway pose.\n\nARCHITECTURAL CONCEPT:\n\nBuild the entire campaign around a monumental sculptural installation inspired by elongated architectural petals and flowing stone blades.\n\nCreate approximately six enormous curved stone structures rising from the ground.\n\nEach structure is tall, narrow, organic, and dramatically curved.\n\nThey should resemble giant architectural fins or elongated mineral petals.\n\nUse warm ivory limestone mixed with pale blush travertine.\n\nEach structure has a slightly different curve, thickness, height, and angle.\n\nNo two structures should be identical.\n\nAvoid perfect symmetry.\n\nThe forms should overlap naturally and create multiple layers of depth.\n\nSome structures should lean inward toward the woman.\n\nOthers should curve outward toward the sky.\n\nThe architecture should create a visual tunnel around the model.\n\nThe stone forms must look extremely heavy and physically engineered.\n\nThey should have realistic weight, thickness, seams, edges, pores, mineral grain, and subtle imperfections.\n\nDo NOT make them look like paper.\n\nDo NOT make them look like fabric.\n\nDo NOT make them look inflatable.\n\nDo NOT create a literal flower.\n\nThe architecture should feel like a completely new luxury art installation.\n\nHIDDEN PORTRAIT SYSTEM:\n\nCreate THREE monochrome portrait impressions of the SAME woman within the architectural stone structures.\n\nThese must NOT look like ordinary photographs attached to the sculpture.\n\nThey should appear mysteriously embedded into the inner surfaces of the curved stone.\n\nThe edges should dissolve naturally into the architecture.\n\nThe effect should feel halfway between archival photography and an impossible architectural memory.\n\nPORTRAIT ONE:\n\nPlace a large monochrome portrait high on the upper-left architectural structure.\n\nThe same woman wears elegant black sunglasses.\n\nShe faces toward the viewer with a calm confident expression.\n\nHer long dark-brown hair remains consistent with the main woman's identity.\n\nThe portrait is softly faded into the stone.\n\nPORTRAIT TWO:\n\nPlace another monochrome portrait deeper inside the central-right architectural structure.\n\nThe same woman looks downward.\n\nOne hand gently touches a section of her hair.\n\nThe image should be partially obscured by the curved stone edge.\n\nPORTRAIT THREE:\n\nPlace the third monochrome portrait near the lower-right area.\n\nThe same woman wears black sunglasses and gently adjusts them while looking toward distant light.\n\nOnly part of the portrait should be visible.\n\nDo not arrange the three portraits in a row.\n\nDo not create a grid.\n\nDo not create identical portrait sizes.\n\nGive each portrait a different scale, crop, height, and level of visibility.\n\nThe portraits should feel accidentally discovered within the architecture.\n\nPORTRAIT MATERIAL:\n\nUse extremely subtle charcoal-gray monochrome photography.\n\nVery low saturation.\n\nSoft silver-gray highlights.\n\nSlight archival photographic texture.\n\nThe portraits should have realistic photographic depth rather than painted faces.\n\nTheir tonal values should interact naturally with the stone.\n\nThey should become more visible where sunlight touches the architecture.\n\nThey should almost disappear inside deeper shadows.\n\nARCHITECTURAL SIGNATURE:\n\nOn one large foreground stone surface, subtly carve a tiny minimalist heart symbol into the limestone.\n\nThe carving should look physically engraved into the stone.\n\nKeep it extremely subtle.\n\nNo large logo.\n\nNo giant typography.\n\nNo obvious advertising.\n\nThe architecture itself should be the recognizable visual signature of the fashion house.\n\nENVIRONMENT:\n\nCreate an extraordinary open-air luxury architectural courtyard.\n\nThe installation stands above a shallow reflective water surface.\n\nCreate a polished pale-stone walkway emerging from the water.\n\nThe woman stands naturally on this walkway.\n\nWater should surround parts of the architecture.\n\nThe surface should contain delicate realistic ripples.\n\nAdd a small number of pale pink blossoms floating naturally on the water.\n\nDo not overcrowd the scene.\n\nIn the distant background, create a very subtle hazy mountain horizon visible through the architectural openings.\n\nThe mountains should remain soft and atmospheric.\n\nAdd delicate flowering branches entering from the far left edge and a few restrained branches near the right background.\n\nThe botanical elements should feel naturally integrated into the architecture.\n\nNo furniture.\n\nNo buildings.\n\nNo extra people.\n\nFLOOR:\n\nUse polished warm ivory stone.\n\nCreate realistic reflections of the woman's shoes, trousers, architecture, and sunlight.\n\nReflections should be slightly distorted rather than mirror-perfect.\n\nWater and stone should meet naturally.\n\nAdd realistic small surface imperfections.\n\nLIGHTING:\n\nUse warm late-afternoon golden-hour sunlight.\n\nThe primary sunlight comes from the upper-left side of the environment.\n\nWarm sunlight passes between the architectural structures.\n\nCreate strong but soft-edged highlights along the limestone surfaces.\n\nThe woman receives warm directional light across her face and coat.\n\nCreate a delicate golden rim light around the edges of her hair.\n\nThe ivory trousers and top should reflect soft warm light.\n\nThe blush coat should catch subtle peach-gold highlights.\n\nDeep architectural shadows should form between the stone structures.\n\nThe monochrome portraits should remain partially hidden in shadow.\n\nCreate realistic ambient bounce light from the pale stone.\n\nAdd subtle reflected light from the water.\n\nNo harsh artificial studio lighting.\n\nBOTANICAL SHADOWS:\n\nAllow delicate flowering branches to cast organic shadows across the limestone surfaces.\n\nThe shadows should be soft and slightly blurred.\n\nThey should overlap naturally with the architectural textures.\n\nAvoid decorative wallpaper-like shadows.\n\nMake them look like real sunlight passing through nearby branches.\n\nCOMPOSITION:\n\nVertical 2:3.\n\nThe woman is the primary visual anchor.\n\nPlace her approximately in the center-lower portion of the composition.\n\nHer full body must be visible from head to shoes.\n\nThe monumental architecture rises dramatically around her.\n\nUse the nearest stone structures as foreground framing elements.\n\nAllow some architectural forms to partially overlap the edges of the frame.\n\nCreate strong depth from foreground stone to middle-ground woman to distant architecture and mountains.\n\nKeep the three monochrome portraits distributed organically through the composition.\n\nDo not create a symmetrical layout.\n\nDo not center every architectural element.\n\nUse asymmetrical balance.\n\nLeave controlled breathing space around the woman's head.\n\nThe viewer's eye should naturally travel:\n\nwoman → architecture → hidden portraits → water → distant horizon.\n\nCAMERA:\n\nProfessional medium-format luxury fashion photography.\n\nVertical 2:3 frame.\n\nSlightly low camera position.\n\nFull-body editorial composition.\n\nModerate telephoto perspective.\n\nApproximately 85mm lens character.\n\nNatural perspective compression.\n\nNo wide-angle distortion.\n\nKeep the woman proportionally realistic.\n\nSharp focus on the woman's face and outfit.\n\nArchitecture remains highly detailed but slightly softer toward the distant background.\n\nUse subtle depth of field.\n\nNatural cinematic lens rendering.\n\nProfessional high-end fashion campaign photography.\n\nCOLOR PALETTE:\n\nWarm ivory limestone\nPale blush stone\nDusty rose\nSoft cream\nWarm beige\nMuted champagne\nCharcoal monochrome\nNatural skin tones\nSoft brown hair\n\nKeep the palette sophisticated and restrained.\n\nNo neon.\n\nNo highly saturated colors.\n\nNo artificial color effects.\n\nMATERIAL REALISM:\n\nExtremely detailed natural limestone.\n\nVisible travertine pores.\n\nSubtle mineral veins.\n\nTiny natural imperfections.\n\nRealistic stone edges.\n\nAuthentic wool-cashmere coat texture.\n\nIndividual fabric fibers.\n\nNatural silk texture.\n\nDetailed tailored trouser construction.\n\nRealistic leather sneaker texture.\n\nSubtle gold reflections.\n\nPhysically accurate water reflections.\n\nRealistic atmospheric haze.\n\nNatural environmental shadows.\n\nPHOTOREALISM:\n\nUltra-photorealistic human skin.\n\nVisible but subtle natural pores.\n\nIndividual eyelashes.\n\nIndividual hair strands.\n\nNatural flyaways.\n\nRealistic facial micro-texture.\n\nAccurate hands and fingers.\n\nCorrect anatomy.\n\nRealistic fabric weight.\n\nNatural clothing folds.\n\nPhysically believable stone.\n\nRealistic sunlight scattering.\n\nNatural water physics.\n\nSubtle medium-format photographic grain.\n\nPremium cinematic color grading.\n\nNo artificial CGI appearance.\n\nART DIRECTION:\n\nThe final image should look like a real luxury fashion campaign photographed at a world-class architectural art installation.\n\nIt should not look like a Pinterest collage.\n\nIt should not look like a fashion moodboard.\n\nIt should not look like a poster template.\n\nThe architecture, fashion, portrait art, water, and natural light should feel like one physically existing location.\n\nThe visual story should be:\n\nFIRST LOOK:\nAn elegant woman standing inside an extraordinary stone installation.\n\nSECOND LOOK:\nThe viewer notices the unusual curved architecture.\n\nTHIRD LOOK:\nThe viewer discovers three mysterious monochrome versions of the same woman hidden inside the stone.\n\nThe result should feel quiet, intelligent, cinematic, collectible, mysterious, and unmistakably designer-driven.\n\nNEGATIVE PROMPT:\n\nNo identity change.\nNo different face.\nNo face morphing.\nNo facial redesign.\nNo different hairstyle from the creative hair description.\nNo short hair.\nNo ponytail.\nNo braid.\nNo tight curls.\nNo plastic hair.\n\nNo dress.\nNo skirt.\nNo sweater.\nNo jeans.\nNo denim.\nNo sneakers in colors other than ivory.\nNo casual streetwear.\nNo excessive jewelry.\nNo oversized accessories.\n\nNo side profile.\nNo back-facing pose.\nNo walking-away pose.\nNo stiff mannequin pose.\nNo exaggerated runway pose.\nNo distorted hands.\nNo extra fingers.\nNo missing fingers.\nNo duplicated limbs.\nNo duplicated bodies.\nNo extra people.\n\nNo conventional photo collage.\nNo rectangular portrait panels.\nNo picture frames.\nNo floating photographs.\nNo mirrors.\nNo magazine pages.\nNo grid layout.\nNo repeated identical portraits.\n\nNo giant flower.\nNo symmetrical flower sculpture.\nNo ordinary studio backdrop.\nNo generic beige room.\nNo fantasy castle.\nNo futuristic spaceship.\nNo excessive props.\nNo excessive flowers.\n\nNo giant readable text.\nNo random lettering.\nNo large logo.\nNo watermark.\nNo artificial typography.\n\nNo neon.\nNo oversaturated colors.\nNo cartoon.\nNo illustration.\nNo anime.\nNo CGI-looking skin.\nNo plastic skin.\nNo unrealistic reflections.\nNo distorted architecture.\n\nFINAL OUTPUT:\n\nUltra-photorealistic luxury fashion campaign.\nArchitectural surrealism.\nContemporary designer fashion.\nEditorial photography.\nMuseum-quality art direction.\nNatural human realism.\nPremium medium-format photography.\nCinematic golden-hour atmosphere.\nHighly detailed materials.\nVertical 2:3 composition.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSRIgMAaYAAQfgV.jpg"]},{"i":19013,"text":"请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的3:4竖版高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。\n\n画面上下两个区域高度严格1:1，各占50%。\n\n上半部分：2026\n\n完整保留原始照片。\n\n严格保持人物身份、五官、面部结构、发型、姿态、视线方向、主体位置、构图、真实光影和环境关系。\n\n不改变人物，不更换服装，不重新设计场景。\n\n保持当前真实数码摄影、手机摄影或相机摄影质感，仅进行轻度高级调色。\n\n下半部分：1985\n\n将上半部分的同一个瞬间重新拍摄于1985年前后。\n\n必须严格保持：\n\n同一个人物、同一张脸、同一个姿态、同一个视线方向、同一个主体位置、同一套构图关系。\n\n人物身份不得发生变化。\n\n根据1985年前后的真实时代特征，对画面中的：\n\n服装、家具、车辆、街道设施、商店招牌、生活用品、室内装饰、建筑细节、路人穿着\n\n进行年代化重构。\n\n整体呈现真实的1980年代35mm彩色胶片摄影效果：\n\n细密胶片颗粒、轻微褪色、暖色色偏、直接闪光、轻微失焦、曝光误差、高光溢出、暗部颗粒、镜头柔化、纸质照片扫描纹理。\n\n允许加入克制的日期戳、冲洗痕迹和轻微划痕。\n\n最终效果必须让人感觉：\n\n这不是把2026年的照片做旧，而是真的找到了同一个人在1985年拍摄的另一张照片。\n\n禁止换脸。\n禁止改变人物动作。\n禁止明显AI绘画感。\n禁止动漫、插画、油画效果。\n禁止只增加黄色滤镜和颗粒。\n禁止上下人物身份不一致。\n\n📌 一句话总结\n\n上传一张今天的照片，让AI替你补拍一张40年前的自己。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSTrztDa0AAh1f3.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSTr1-AbgAAXWAT.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSTr1--aUAA2ZqM.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSTr1-6agAAeJ7a.jpg"]},{"i":19014,"text":"开始，而是先让MiniMax Design 在 Blender 里搭了场景、放好角色，做了一版白模动画，再拿去给AI参考。\n\n我的分工很简单：\n\n▫️ 白模管动作和空间 角色走哪条路，台阶摆在哪里，镜头怎么跟，先在这里安排。\n\n▫️ 角色图管长相和装备 另外给人物参考，说明脸和服装该长什么样，避免把方块人也照着生成。\n\n▫️ 提示词讲清楚哪些要留、哪些要改 我会明确写： 「参考白模的走位、机位和场景关系，不沿用白模外观；人物和材质按效果参考。」\n\n这句分工挺重要。\n\n白模是让它参考“怎么拍”，不是让它继续拍方块人。\n\n在这个视频里，角色的行进状态、右侧台阶和背景平台，还能看出原来的设计关系。人物和环境细节则被AI重新演绎了，不是原模型直接上材质。\n\n目前我觉得，白模不用一上来就做得很精致，但你在意的位置和动作，最好先摆明白。\n\n把这次的白模和效果放一起，给同样在试这条路的朋友一个参考。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2100062854896660480/img/F0QhCmaM1VLpn9Zb.jpg"]},{"i":19015,"text":"1980s commercial airbrush illustration, retro Japanese sci-fi advertising art, hand-painted airbrush rendering with smooth sculpted volume and glossy tonal gradients, crisp comic-style ink contour lines, sharp graphic silhouette,\n\nan original adult anime woman strongly reminiscent of Furina, elegant aristocratic appearance, pale silver-white hair with subtle icy blue accents, refined theatrical hairstyle, cool blue eyes, confident aloof expression,\n\nwearing a complete fully covered crimson patent-leather bodysuit, sleek form-fitting silhouette, glossy lacquered red surface, high collar, long sleeves, integrated gloves and boots, sophisticated futuristic tailoring, subtle black industrial mechanical details, no exposed midriff, no lingerie elements,\n\npure absolute black background, enormous uninterrupted black negative space, black areas on the character rendered as deep glossy specular reflections and industrial mechanical black, strong polished highlights on the red patent leather, controlled hard-edged reflections,\n\nfull-body character visible from head to toe, character occupies only about 40% of the total image, slightly below center, surrounded by vast empty black space, minimalist vertical composition, isolated single subject, clean silhouette, no environmental scenery, no decorative background elements,\n\nauthentic 1980s airbrush poster finish, analog commercial illustration, subtle painted gradients, polished retro-futurist rendering, graphic comic linework, not photorealistic, no text, no typography, no logo, no watermark","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSULF27bMAA_YXt.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSULYwkaAAErJD0.jpg"]},{"i":19016,"text":"Create an ultra-realistic premium smartphone street-fashion photo of the same person casually leaning against a tall silver metal pole in a modern glass-building plaza during bright daytime.\n\nKeep the person's face highly recognizable and unchanged from the reference. Do not redesign or beautify the face.\n\nStyle: long natural dark wavy hair, burgundy cropped leather jacket, white button-up shirt, burgundy slim tie, cream high-waisted wide-leg trousers, black formal shoes, black rectangular glasses, delicate silver jewelry and trouser chain.\n\nPose: relaxed lean against the pole, hands naturally near the trouser pockets, legs casually crossed, looking slightly to the side.\n\nBeside the pole, add a small cute collectible cartoon version of the SAME person wearing the same outfit and hairstyle with sunglasses.\n\nBackground: clean modern urban plaza, glass buildings, stone pavement, greenery.\n\nAdd a large dark translucent floating music-player UI behind the subjects with canoe-on-water album artwork and minimal playback controls. Never cover the face or important clothing.\n\nBright natural sunlight, realistic shadows, natural skin texture, realistic hair and fabric, flagship smartphone photography, approximately 50mm perspective, vertical 3:4 composition, full-body framing, premium fashion editorial look.\n\nIMPORTANT:\nReference image = WHO the person is.\nPrompt = WHAT the person is wearing, doing and where they are.\n\nNo face change, no generic face, no identity mixing, no CGI human, no plastic skin, no distorted hands, no extra fingers, no bad anatomy, no incorrect outfit, no oversized cartoon, no excessive blur.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSUMMGLacAAGDbB.jpg"]},{"i":19017,"text":"Create a 30-second cinematic 3D animated comedy-romance story in the exact same warm, expressive Pixar-like visual style as the previous storyboard. Keep the same young couple characters, consistent faces and clothing, realistic cartoon proportions, expressive eyes, soft cinematic lighting, detailed environments, and smooth animation. The story should have clear visual storytelling with no unnecessary dialogue.\nScene 1 — 0–5 sec: The Excited Trip\nA young boyfriend and girlfriend happily drive together to a premium electronics store. They are excited and smiling, imagining buying the brand-new iPhone 18 Pro Max in Burgundy. Show the phone beautifully displayed inside the store with dramatic lighting.\nScene 2 — 5–10 sec: The Price Shock\nThe girlfriend excitedly points at the Burgundy iPhone 18 Pro Max. The boyfriend confidently reaches into his pocket and opens his wallet.\nNothing. Completely empty.\nHis smile disappears. His eyes become huge. He nervously checks every pocket again—even turns the wallet upside down and shakes it.\nThe girlfriend's excited expression slowly turns into disappointment.\nScene 3 — 10–14 sec: Sad Walk Home\nThe girlfriend quietly walks away from the store with a sad, disappointed expression. The boyfriend watches helplessly.\nCut to their home.\nShe sits alone on the couch, looking down sadly, imagining the Burgundy iPhone in her hands. The boyfriend looks at her with a worried expression, then quietly leaves the house.\nScene 4 — 14–23 sec: The Mystery\nShow a fast-paced montage of the boyfriend disappearing for about an hour.\nHe walks quickly through the city, determined and slightly exhausted. Build comedic mystery—he checks his pockets, looks at his phone, runs through the streets, and finally returns home carrying a beautifully packaged Burgundy iPhone 18 Pro Max.\nScene 5 — 23–27 sec: The Surprise\nThe girlfriend is still sitting sadly on the couch.\nThe boyfriend walks toward her and secretly places the brand-new Burgundy iPhone 18 Pro Max in her hands.\nShe looks down.\nHer eyes widen.\nShe looks at him in complete shock.\nThen her sadness instantly turns into an enormous happy smile. ❤️\nScene 6 — 27–30 sec: Happy Ending\nShe jumps up, hugs him tightly, and gives him a quick affectionate kiss on the lips.\nThe boyfriend smiles proudly.\nFinal shot: They sit together on the couch, happily admiring the new Burgundy iPhone 18 Pro Max, with warm cinematic lighting and a wholesome romantic ending.\nAnimation direction: expressive Pixar-like facial animation, exaggerated reactions, cinematic camera movements, smooth body motion, warm emotional storytelling, subtle comedy, beautiful store lighting, detailed home interior, consistent character faces throughout, realistic cloth and hair movement, polished high-quality 3D animated-film appearance.\n#pixverse","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2100101920283389952/img/cPjS3pWiUqb48wL-.jpg"]},{"i":19018,"text":"Young woman, Long loose curly hair , wearing casual clothes, sitting alone in a dark room at night, using her phone, cinematic lighting, soft blue tones, suddenly phone notification appears showing \"Video from: Me\", she looks confused, opens the video, on screen she sees herself but slightly different, more serious expression, subtle glitch effect, future version of her speaking silently, text appears \"Don't open that door\", tension rising, her face becomes shocked, background dark and quiet, suddenly loud knock on the door, she freezes, slow dramatic zoom on her face, cinematic lighting, ultra realistic, 4K, film grain, suspense atmosphere, consistent cinematic tone","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2100200287197937664/img/l36gYQXLpxNFFnUm.jpg"]},{"i":19019,"text":"Single continuous handheld selfie shot, vertical phone front-camera footage, plain indoor window daylight, no color grading, faint sensor noise in the shadows and a soft auto-exposure wobble.\n\nA woman @image1(u genrate)is already holding a small tabby kitten up against her chest with one hand, her other arm stretched out with the phone, her face leaning in close to the lens and the kitten's head right beside her chin. She is murmuring to it, a short laugh escaping through her nose, her thumb rubbing the fur behind its ear. Then the kitten twists in her grip and swats one front paw straight at her chin — she sucks in a sharp breath, flinches back with her eyes squeezing shut, and the laugh bursts out of her, shoulders shaking, loose strands of her tied-back hair swinging across her cheek, and through it she gets out, breaking up with laughter, in casual everyday colloquial English: \"Ow— okay, okay, I get it—\" A beat later the kitten scrambles up toward her shoulder, its claws catching the ribbed edge of her top; she yelps into another giggle, catches its hind legs with her palm and slides it back down her chest, then presses her cheek against the top of its head and puffs a breath into its fur, still hiccupping small laughs between breaths. The kitten's ears flick back and its paw comes up again, and at the end it reaches directly toward the lens — the frame drifts and dips as her arm moves, the focus breathing once as the paw fills the near corner — while she pulls her head away, her laugh cracking and swallowing the rest of the words, and says, laughing and cutting herself off, in casual everyday colloquial English: \"You little—\" Her hand keeps supporting the squirming kitten, her chest still jumping with the tail end of the laugh, and both of them are moving as the clip runs out.\n\nShoot it as one continuous handheld front-camera selfie — no cuts, no zoom, natural arm drift and re-centering, the camera is the phone in her hand. Keep the framing tight on the two of them from the chest up, with exactly ONE kitten in frame and no other animal at any point. Let the laughter be physical and unpolished: it interrupts her own words mid-syllable, creases her eyes shut, shakes the phone in her hand, and leaves her breathing unevenly between lines. Handheld jitter and one brief auto-exposure hunt as she turns toward the window are wanted, but the kitten's individual fur strands and whiskers, her skin texture and the fine hairs at her temple stay razor-sharp through every movement. Strictly no subtitles, no on-screen text, no logo, no watermark. Never render a reference sheet or duplicate a subject. Diegetic sound only: fabric rustling as the kitten scrambles, one thin mewl, a nose-laugh, the sharp intake of breath, her unguarded bursting laugh with small hiccupping giggles under it, and her two short lines delivered frontally with her mouth visible, no background music. Audio: dialogue and diegetic sound effects only, no background music","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2100227143842369536/img/K-VuB05AVZ5eIHzd.jpg"]},{"i":19020,"text":"Luxury Japanese-style travel poster.\n\nSoft colors. Clean lines. Lots of empty space.\n\n[ Poster Series - Part 3 ]\n\nPrompt:\n\n{\n  \"prompt_name\": \"City Identity Travel Poster - Minimalist Vector Series\",\n  \"format\": {\n    \"orientation\": \"vertical\",\n    \"aspect_ratio\": \"9:16\",\n    \"style_category\": \"premium flat-vector illustration\"\n  },\n  \"subject\": {\n    \"city_placeholder\": \"[CITY_NAME]\",\n    \"country_placeholder\": \"[COUNTRY_NAME]\",\n    \"brief\": \"Design a bespoke, elegant travel poster that reflects the true visual soul of [CITY_NAME]. Every layout must feel custom-built for that city, never a reused template.\"\n  },\n  \"city_identity_elements\": {\n    \"instruction\": \"Build the scene using these five anchors, reinterpreted per city\",\n    \"elements\": [\n      \"A well-known landmark, structural detail, or skyline silhouette\",\n      \"A signature local mode of transport or movement\",\n      \"A small, quiet slice-of-life moment\",\n      \"A native plant, terrain, or environmental trait\",\n      \"A camera angle and layout that feels native to that city's geography\"\n    ],\n    \"composition_variety_note\": \"Scene layout must differ from city to city — no repeated object placement or fixed visual formula\",\n    \"composition_options\": [\n      \"harbor lookout\", \"old-town alley\", \"riverside park\", \"coastal walkway\",\n      \"hilltop city view\", \"bustling market lane\", \"streetcar boulevard\",\n      \"boat dock\", \"garden setting\", \"historic plaza\", \"beachfront walk\",\n      \"cultural courtyard\", \"rooftop skyline view\"\n    ],\n    \"selection_rule\": \"Pick the layout that most naturally suits [CITY_NAME]\"\n  },\n  \"typography\": {\n    \"layout_reference\": \"Match the header style exactly as shown in the reference image\",\n    \"placement\": \"upper-left corner, positioned in the sky/negative-space area above the skyline\",\n    \"city_name\": {\n      \"text\": \"[CITY_NAME],\",\n      \"line_1\": \"[CITY_NAME],\",\n      \"line_2\": \"[COUNTRY_NAME] [COUNTRY_FLAG_EMOJI]\",\n      \"format\": \"city name and country name stacked across two lines, large bold rounded serif or humanist serif font, deep navy/charcoal color\",\n      \"flag_placement\": \"small national flag emoji placed directly after the country name, same line, same baseline\",\n      \"font_size\": \"large, dominant but not overpowering — roughly 2 short lines of big text\"\n    },\n    \"divider\": {\n      \"style\": \"short thin horizontal rule line\",\n      \"color\": \"muted terracotta or dusty coral\",\n      \"placement\": \"directly beneath the two-line title block, left-aligned, short width (not full poster width)\"\n    },\n    \"tagline\": {\n      \"text\": \"one short, refined English tagline matching the mood of the city\",\n      \"placement\": \"directly below the divider line, left-aligned\",\n      \"style\": \"small, light-weight, letter-spaced, muted navy/gray, understated and editorial\"\n    },\n    \"overall_style\": \"minimal, editorial, airy, upscale — text block stays compact in the upper-left with generous surrounding negative space, never overpowering the artwork\"\n  },\n  \"visual_hierarchy\": {\n    \"focal_point\": \"single standout landmark or architectural element\",\n    \"supporting_details\": \"2 to 4 well-chosen local touches only, each reinforcing sense of place\",\n    \"avoid\": \"landmark montages, postcard clutter, overcrowded scenes — keep it calm and deliberate\"\n  },\n  \"people\": {\n    \"count\": \"3 to 6 small-scale figures\",\n    \"activities\": [\n      \"strolling an old lane\", \"riding a bike\", \"waiting at a transit stop\",\n      \"sketching a building\", \"boarding a boat\", \"reading outside\",\n      \"snapping a quiet photo\", \"carrying beach gear\", \"browsing a stall\",\n      \"jogging along the water\"\n    ],\n    \"rules\": \"No crowds, no single dominant figure — people should blend naturally into the setting\"\n  },\n  \"local_character\": {\n    \"use_only_if_authentic\": true,\n    \"categories\": [\n      \"local transit\", \"architecture\", \"street furniture\", \"plant life\",\n      \"small directional signage\", \"regional food cues\", \"leisure activities\",\n      \"ground markings\", \"cultural touches\"\n    ],\n    \"signage_guidance\": \"Keep transit/signage subtle — use a small transit marker, clock, dock info panel, bike icon, painted street marking, beach flag, or minimal metro symbol instead of a large sign\"\n  },\n  \"art_direction\": {\n    \"keywords\": [\n      \"Japanese stationery-inspired look\",\n      \"luxury sticker-style illustration\",\n      \"premium commercial vector art\",\n      \"modern editorial travel branding\",\n      \"fine clean outlines\",\n      \"consistent line weight\",\n      \"simplified geometric shapes\",\n      \"flat color fills\",\n      \"soft rounded forms\",\n      \"balanced visual flow\",\n      \"high-end minimalist postcard style\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"color_system\": {\n    \"primary_palette\": [\"pale powder blue\", \"soft sky blue\", \"mist blue\", \"cool airy blue tones\"],\n    \"secondary_palette\": [\"warm ivory\", \"cream\", \"soft beige\", \"muted sage\", \"gray-green\", \"quiet architectural neutrals\"],\n    \"accent_palette\": {\n      \"colors\": [\"dusty rose\", \"muted blush\", \"terracotta (for divider line)\"],\n      \"usage\": \"small accents only — flowers, clothing details, signage, awnings, decorative touches, typography divider\"\n    },\n    \"overall_tone\": \"soft, refined, slightly muted, harmonious\"\n  },\n  \"mood\": [\"fresh\", \"airy\", \"peaceful\", \"polished\", \"contemporary\", \"elegant\"],\n  \"final_feel\": \"should read like a high-end boutique travel postcard or luxury lifestyle illustration, with open breathing space and a relaxed sense of place\",\n  \"quality_rules\": {\n    \"uniqueness\": \"Every city needs its own distinct visual identity\",\n    \"variation\": \"Adjust camera angle, scene layout, landmark position, foreground elements, and supporting details based on the city's character\",\n    \"typography_consistency\": \"The two-line city/country title + flag emoji + short divider + tagline layout in the upper-left must stay consistent across every city poster in the series\",\n    \"prohibition\": \"Do not just swap the city name into a recycled composition\"\n  },\n  \"negative_prompt\": [\n    \"no photorealism\", \"no realism\", \"no watercolor\", \"no painterly brushstrokes\",\n    \"no gradients\", \"no heavy shadows\", \"no dramatic cinematic lighting\",\n    \"no paper texture\", \"no excessive detail\", \"no cluttered background\",\n    \"no landmark collage\", \"no crowded streets\", \"no oversized figures\",\n    \"no single dominant character\", \"no repetitive café scene\",\n    \"no fixed signage placement\", \"no identical foreground treatment\",\n    \"no generic tourist-poster look\", \"no copied layout from another city\",\n    \"no unnecessary decoration\", \"no full-width divider line\", \"no centered title block\"\n  ]\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HS7kZRrbIAAScMc.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HS7kZRraMAAELnF.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HS7kZRqbUAAxnS2.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HS7kZRobEAAwIOf.jpg"]},{"i":19021,"text":"请基于我上传的照片，制作一张独立的3:4竖版“焦外抽离双生”视觉海报。\n\n画面严格分为上下两个区域，高度1:1，各占50%。\n\n上下必须保持：\n\n同一个主体、同一张脸、同一个动作、同一个姿态、同一个视线方向、同一个主体位置、同一个场景、同一个拍摄角度、同一套构图关系。\n\n不要重新设计人物。\n\n不要更换背景。\n\n不要改变照片内容。\n\n上半部分｜REAL\n\n完整保留上传的原始照片。\n\n保持原始手机摄影、数码相机或生活抓拍质感。\n\n人物、背景、环境信息全部保留。\n\n可以进行轻度曝光和色彩整理，但不要改变景深关系。\n\n让观众能够明确看到照片原本的真实状态。\n\n下半部分｜85MM F/1.2\n\n严格基于上半部分相同画面重新模拟一次专业全画幅大光圈人像摄影。\n\n模拟：\n\n85mm全画幅定焦镜头，f/1.2光圈。\n\n主体眼睛、面部、主要轮廓保持高清锐利。\n\n根据真实空间距离重新计算景深。\n\n主体所在焦平面清晰。\n\n主体前后的环境按照距离逐级进入失焦状态。\n\n近距离背景保持少量结构。\n\n中距离背景开始柔化。\n\n远距离背景完全转化为自然奶油焦外。\n\n背景中的：\n\n路灯、车灯、橱窗、树叶反光、金属反射、阳光高光\n\n自然转化为不同大小、不同虚化程度的真实光学bokeh。\n\n焦外必须具有真实镜头特征：\n\n柔和圆形光斑、边缘轻微猫眼形变、高光渐变、前后景深层次、真实空间压缩感。\n\n人物头发、肩膀、衣服边缘不能出现人工抠图感。\n\n发丝与焦外之间需要自然过渡。\n\n保留轻微镜头呼吸、色散、颗粒、曝光误差和真实摄影缺陷。\n\n最终效果必须像：\n\n同一个摄影师没有移动位置，只把普通手机换成了一支85mm F1.2专业镜头重新拍了一次。\n\n禁止：\n\n整块背景高斯模糊。\n\n禁止背景变成没有空间层级的一团颜色。\n\n禁止把人物抠出来贴在模糊背景上。\n\n禁止换脸。\n\n禁止改变人物动作。\n\n禁止增加不存在的建筑或景物。\n\n禁止插画感。\n\n禁止过度磨皮。\n\n禁止塑料皮肤。\n\n禁止AI棚拍感。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSYwjsZbIAAf2PA.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSYwjseaAAA3dZT.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSYwjsZaEAAaVKp.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSYwnCrbQAI_jCP.jpg"]},{"i":19022,"text":"Vertical 9:16 format, 15-second continuous cinematic shot in one single take. Photorealistic real-life image, realistic physics, strong spatial continuity, premium fashion-film cinematography, natural daylight, realistic materials and shallow depth of field\n0.0-2.5 s - Begin low at the feet of the main character from the character reference, walking naturally through the Seoul urban environment from IMAGE 1. The camera smoothly tilts upward into a front-facing close-up. He holds IMAGE 2 (mobile phone) against one ear while naturally holding IMAGE 4 (coffee) in the other hand. IMAGE 3 (sunglasses) is worn naturally. Keep face, outfit and proportions consistent.\n2.5-4.0 s - A rushed pedestrian carrying folders and loose papers approaches head-on and accidentally collides with him. The character reacts with surprise, loses balance and falls backward. Papers scatter. The mobile, sunglasses and coffee visibly separate from the character because of the collision.\nOBJECT SPACING - Do NOT arrange the three released objects on one line. Stagger them clearly in 3D space: one higher, one lower and one offset to the side, with different depth positions. Keep them separated enough for distinct cinematic close-ups. No teleportation or spontaneous appearance.\n4.0-5.0 s - Time rapidly slows into dramatic bullet time. The character continues falling in extreme slow motion. Papers and all three objects become suspended around him while retaining exact appearance and believable orientation.\n5.0-6.2 s - Camera moves toward IMAGE 3 (sunglasses), nearly frozen in its natural position. Shallow depth of field; falling character visible in background.\n6.2-7.4 s — Camera moves toward IMAGE 2 (mobile). CRITICAL: show the EXACT FRONT DISPLAY from the uploaded reference, never the back, side or camera module. Push in smoothly so the call-screen text and interface are large, sharp and clearly readable. Preserve the exact screen content and front appearance. No mirrored screen, no redesigned phone, no duplicate.\n7.4-8.8 s - Camera moves toward IMAGE 4 (coffee), suspended separately. Preserve exact cup, lid, straw, label and proportions. Liquid and ice react naturally to inertia.\n8.8-10.2 s - Camera pulls back to reveal the complete frozen scene: falling character, suspended papers, sunglasses, FRONT-FACING mobile and coffee, all separated at different heights/depths.\n10.2-11.0 s - Time abruptly snaps back to NORMAL SPEED. Gravity and momentum resume at realistic full speed. Character, papers, sunglasses, mobile and coffee fall naturally to the pavement. The speed must clearly feel normal, not slow motion.\n11.0-12.0 s - The character remains mostly lying on the ground. He lifts only his upper body slightly and reaches for the coffee.\n12.0-12.7 s - He picks up the COFFEE and keeps it securely in ONE HAND. He takes a natural sip while still holding the coffee. He does NOT put it down or release it.\n12.7-13.7 s - While continuing to hold the coffee in that SAME hand, he uses the OTHER HAND to pick up and put on the sunglasses. Immediately after putting them on, using that SAME OTHER HAND, he picks up the mobile phone. The coffee never leaves the first hand.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2100460456255295488/img/Sm8tdzbFs3iYK986.jpg"]},{"i":19023,"text":"请基于我上传的照片，制作一张独立的 3:4 竖版“画中越界双生”海报。\n\n画面严格分为上下两个区域，高度 1:1，各占 50%。\n\n上半部分\n\n完整保留原始照片。\n\n保持同一个人物、同一张脸、同一个动作、同一个场景、同一个构图。\n\n只做轻微调色，不改变内容。\n\n下半部分\n\n严格保持与上半部分相同的：\n\n主体身份\n面部特征\n姿态动作\n场景关系\n拍摄角度\n构图位置\n\n然后从原图中选择 1 个视觉元素，让它从照片内部自然延伸出来，进入真实空间。\n\n这个元素可以是：\n\n头发、衣摆、丝带、花朵、水流、海浪、烟雾、楼梯、纸张、树枝、光带、产品液体、建筑线条。\n\n要求这个元素：\n\n来源清楚，本来就在照片里\n从平面内部连续延伸到画面外部\n有真实体积感\n有透视关系\n有接触阴影\n有遮挡关系\n与原图材质、颜色、光影统一\n\n最终效果必须像：\n\n照片里的一个元素，真的冲出了平面。\n\n禁止\n禁止换脸\n禁止改动作\n禁止乱加无关元素\n禁止做成贴纸拼贴\n禁止悬浮感\n禁止插画感过强\n禁止失去真实摄影基础\n\n📌一句话总结\n\n上传一张照片，让AI把画面里的一个元素直接“拉出来”。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSd_W-6a0AAZm0v.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSd_YsIaEAAixk9.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSd_YsGbAAA1sZT.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSd_fwsbQAAWQ5u.jpg"]},{"i":19024,"text":"”了!\n白模动画可能不只是参考素材，它本身就是一段提示词。\n只不过，这段提示词不是用文字写的。\n\n文字很容易告诉AI“要有什么”：一个角色、一只生物、一座桥。\n\n但再往下说,它们离多远、谁先靠近、在哪里停下、镜头从哪个角度看就开始费劲了。\n描述越写越长，我也不确定它会把重点放在哪。\n所以这次，我想试着把这部分直接“演”给它看。\n\n还是先用AI工具 在 Blender 里搭场景、放角色、做白模动画。但这次不只安排一个人怎么走，而是先安排两个主体之间的关系，再交给AI生成。\n\n这里有个挺有意思的区别：\n▫️ 角色图告诉它：长成什么样。\n▫️ 白模动画告诉它：事情怎么发生。\n▫️ 文字补充：哪些地方可以发挥，哪些关系要保留。\n\n相当于我没把所有要求都塞进一大段文字，而是换了几种方式表达。\n\n看这次的对照，材质、人物和生物细节被重新演绎了，但桥、地形和双方站位，还能找到白模里的关系。\n一个很粗糙的3D场景，也能承担一部分原本要靠文字反复解释的事。\n你觉得效果怎么样？","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2100807386911170560/img/AbG-VweECfLpGpI_.jpg"]},{"i":19025,"text":"我一查，好家伙，我超多精品\n\n随便晒一套，汤底提示词：\n\n```\n以负空间叙事和纸面影像感建立克制PPT视觉系统，主导理论为格式塔连续性、动态平衡、模块网格与基线节奏：用连续性组织细线、投影与文字的缓慢阅读，用不等量配重让大片空场与一侧高密结构互相牵制，用网格约束信息栏、标题、注释与页脚的对齐。借鉴穆勒-布罗克曼的理性网格控制边距、栏宽和小字号秩序，借鉴布罗多维奇的编辑留白与图文呼吸制造停顿，借鉴田中一光的文化符号几何化方法把装饰转成平面结构，借鉴阿尔伯斯的邻接感知维持低彩度层次。配色只定义角色：背景为最高面积的低彩度高明度承载层，结构线和正文为低明度信息层，半透明影像为中明度氛围层，少量强调信息以更强明度差出现，面积约7:2:1；未来主题配色按角色一键映射，必须保留明度顺序、低彩度、透明叠压和投影可读性。版式采用偏轴模块网格，空场占主导，内容叙事决定标题靠空场内侧、信息列表沿安静轴线排列、焦点图形贴边或越界，唯一破格是细线或影像穿越栏线形成牵引。背景以纤维底材、淡化墨洗和摄影转印的层叠工艺构成，先铺吸收纹理，再叠模糊有机方向影、线性框架和细枝状引导线，边缘虚化、局部残旧、光照漫射。字体采用高反差显示字与低反差小字的对照配对，标题保留修长骨架、开放字腔、细锐收笔和宽松字距，正文以窄行距小字号形成精密注释，任意文字系统都按自身合法笔画、字腔、连结、标记和阅读方向重建同等密度与气息。情绪为含蓄、疏朗、静默、书卷、温润、秩序、余韵。   \n\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSfFVh_asAA_3bX.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSfFWzmbwAAvRKn.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSfFXoTa0AAuxOj.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSfFYy0aEAARd1W.jpg"]},{"i":19026,"text":"Vertical cinematic video, 9:16, ultra-realistic, 8K, 30 seconds duration, 24fps.\nUse the reference image/video strictly for composition, framing, environment, color tone, lighting, and cinematic atmosphere. Maintain the same cool teal cinematic color grading, overcast sky, soft haze, muted contrast, realistic film texture, and natural skin tones throughout the entire video.\nSCENE & ENVIRONMENT\nA young couple stands together on a real-world coastal suspension bridge, matching the reference framing and location aesthetic. The ocean stretches behind them with a distant city skyline partially obscured by atmospheric haze. Overcast teal-gray sky, soft diffused daylight, realistic bridge structure, subtle ocean movement, natural wind, grounded real-world physics.\nThe entire sequence must feel like a frame from a high-budget live-action disaster romance film.\nSTRICT CHARACTER CONSISTENCY LOCK\nThe EXACT SAME man and woman must remain throughout the entire 30-second sequence.\nMan:\n•Mid-20s\n•Messy dark hair\n•Light natural stubble\n•Dark coat\n•Same facial structure, hairstyle, body proportions, clothing, and appearance in every frame\nWoman:\n•Mid-20s\n•Long blonde/light-brown hair\n•Beige coat\n•Same facial structure, hairstyle, body proportions, clothing, and appearance in every frame\nSTRICT IDENTITY LOCK: No face changes, no hairstyle changes, no clothing changes, no age changes, no body-proportion changes, no identity drift.\nCAMERA\nOne continuous cinematic shot with no abrupt cuts.\nSlow, subtle cinematic push-in throughout the entire 30 seconds.\n50mm cinematic lens look. Shallow depth of field. Characters remain sharp while the distant ocean and skyline are slightly defocused.\nSubtle handheld micro-movement for natural realism.\nCamera movement must remain smooth and controlled. At the ocean impact, introduce only a brief, restrained camera vibration.\n0–7 SECONDS — ARGUMENT\nThe couple stands close together, emotionally arguing.\nTheir body language is tense but realistic. They are focused entirely on each other and completely ignore the environment behind them.\nThe woman looks directly at the man, frustrated and emotionally exhausted.\nNatural lip sync as she angrily says:\n\"You will never change!\"\nBrief pause.\nThe man looks at her intensely and responds:\n\"I promise I never will!\"\nTheir expressions remain grounded and believable.\nNo theatrical screaming. No exaggerated gestures. No melodramatic acting.\nAllow several seconds of uncomfortable silence and eye contact after the exchange.\n7–11 SECONDS — SOMETHING IN THE SKY\nWhile they are still focused on each other, a faint glowing rocket/missile streak suddenly becomes visible far behind them in the overcast sky.\nIt moves rapidly across the background toward the ocean.\nThe couple initially does not notice it.\nThe camera continues its slow push-in.\nThe projectile should feel physically realistic and distant.\nNo futuristic spacecraft. No fantasy design. No giant glowing object.\n11–15 SECONDS — OCEAN IMPACT\nThe projectile strikes the ocean at a considerable distance from the bridge.\nA powerful but realistic water impact erupts upward.\nLarge quantities of ocean water violently rise into the air.\nA broad shockwave ripple spreads across the ocean surface.\nNo giant Hollywood fireball.\nInstead:\n•Dense water spray\n•Atmospheric mist\n•Realistic impact displacement\n•Heavy ocean turbulence\n•Subtle distant flash\n•Physically believable water movement\nThe bridge and couple remain safe from the immediate impact.\nThe camera reacts with a very subtle controlled vibration.\nThe lighting slightly dims as mist and atmospheric haze increase.\n15–20 SECONDS — REALIZATION\nThe couple finally notices the impact.\nTheir argument completely stops.\nSilence.\nThe woman's angry expression slowly disappears.\nThe man's intensity softens.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2100963423458918400/img/1vk8lWm90yXg2tb8.jpg"]},{"i":19027,"text":"1:\nA stunning digital art illustration of a traditional East Asian pagoda set against a dramatic night landscape. The scene is illuminated by a large, glowing full moon adorned with delicate golden concentric rings and abstract bird silhouettes flying near it. Below the moon, stylized, jagged mountains rise against a deep black sky dotted with distant stars and golden, linear clouds. A glowing golden multi-tiered pagoda rests on a dark rocky cliffside, surrounded by ornate trees with glowing yellow-gold leaves. A shimmering river winds its way through the landscape, reflecting the moonlight. In the foreground, large, detailed lotus flowers in varying stages of bloom line the riverbanks, their petals radiating a warm golden light against the dark background. The entire composition uses a striking color palette of deep black, warm gold, and subtle amber accents, creating a mystical, serene, and elegant atmosphere.\n\n🏞 Prompt 2:\nA highly detailed stylized nightscape illustration in a luxury editorial poster aesthetic, rendered with crisp linework and glowing contrast against a deep black background. The scene centers on a luminous golden moon rising behind layered mountain silhouettes, with a refined Japanese pagoda beside a reflective stream, all bathed in warm amber, cream, and muted blue-gray tones.\nEnvironment:\n• A serene landscape with a large full moon dominating the upper center background\n• Dark, layered mountain ranges stretching across the horizon, with elegant contour lines and subtle highlights\n• A multi-tier pagoda positioned right of center, perched on rocky ground beside the water, with curved rooflines and softly glowing windows\n• A winding reflective stream running from the midground toward the foreground center, creating a bright path of moonlit reflection\n• Lotus flowers and tall grasses framing both sides of the foreground, especially clustered at lower left and lower right\n• Stylized cloud bands passing horizontally across the moon, with small stars and a few tiny bird silhouettes in the sky\n• Additional small architectural detail faintly visible in the midground left near the water\n• Avoid modern elements, clutter, heavy realism, or dense texture noise\nLighting:\n• Strong moon backlight from the large central moon, creating a radiant halo and soft atmospheric glow\n• Warm internal glow within the pagoda, contrasting with the cool darkness of the mountains and sky\n• Gentle highlights along roof edges, flower petals, rocks, and water ripples\n• Reflections in the stream should be luminous and controlled, not mirror-sharp\n• No harsh shadows, no blown-out moon detail, no flat unlit foreground\nMaterials:\n• Smooth ink-like black negative space with metallic gold and ivory highlights\n• Pagoda surfaces with polished wood-like warmth and fine architectural edging\n• Water rendered with silky reflective lines and soft layered shimmer\n• Flowers with delicate satin-like petals and softly glowing centers\n• Rocky terrain in matte charcoal with clean stylized edge lighting\nComposition:\n• Vertical poster composition, centered around the moon and water reflection axis\n• Pagoda occupying the right midground as the hero structure, balanced by floral masses on both sides\n• Mountains layered behind the pagoda to create depth without overwhelming the moon\n• Strong use of negative space around the upper sky and outer edges for dramatic contrast\n• Hero elements fill most of the frame with a symmetrical visual rhythm, though not perfectly mirrored\nMood:\nQuiet, majestic, dreamlike, and elegant with a tranquil nocturnal fantasy atmosphere\nUltra-detailed digital illustration, sharp ornamental linework, high contrast, vertical 4:5 composition, glowing gold-on-black palette, polished cinematic finish.\n\n🏞 Prompt 3:\nA serene Japanese landscape bathed in the warm glow of a large, luminous full moon. A multi-tiered pagoda, adorned with intricate golden details and traditional roofing, stands majestically on a rocky outcrop. It is surrounded by lush, golden-hued foliage and large, delicate lotus flowers in shades of cream and soft orange. A tranquil river, reflecting the moonlight and surrounding scenery, gently flows through the foreground. Jagged, dark mountains form the backdrop, silhouetted against the vibrant sky. The atmosphere is mystical and peaceful, with a hint of ancient grandeur. The color palette is dominated by deep blacks, contrasting with bright yellows, golds, and soft oranges, creating a striking visual. The composition is framed by darkness, emphasizing the illuminated central elements, with a low-angle perspective drawing the viewer into the scene. The style is reminiscent of traditional Japanese ink paintings with a touch of fantasy illustration, featuring smooth textures and dramatic lighting.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HShbUP6XYAAYejA.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HShbt9gXQAAQ9TW.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HShbWH8WcAARY5N.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/HShbRDqXwAAyQWU.jpg"]},{"i":19028,"text":"xAI's Grok Imagine Image 2.0 takes #4 on the Artificial Analysis Text to Image Leaderboard, the highest ranked model outside OpenAI, a 14 place climb over the previous generation, and lands on the Pareto frontier for quality vs price\n\nGrok Imagine Image 2.0 is xAI's latest image model released in August. The model supports text to image, image editing, as well as multi-reference generations with up to five input images.\n\nGrok Imagine Image 2.0 is a large step up on the previous generation grok-imagine-image-quality: it climbs from #18 to #4 in Text to Image and from #16 to #10 in Image Editing, closing the gap to the leaders on every Text to Image capability and use case we measure, with the largest gains in Knowledge, Text Rendering and Lighting.\n\nGrok Imagine Image 2.0 is available through the xAI API as grok-imagine-image-2.0, in Grok Imagine on  and the Grok apps, and through fal and Replicate.\n\nCongratulations to @SpaceXAI and @elonmusk on the release!\n\nSee below for our analysis and example outputs of Grok Imagine Image 2.0 in the Artificial Analysis Image Arena 🧵","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/HSiT7ZgakAAbyDr.jpg"]},{"i":19029,"text":"请基于我上传的照片，制作一张独立的 3:4竖版“影子剧场双生”海报。\n\n画面上下严格 1:1 分割。\n\n上半部分\n\n完整保留原始照片。\n\n保持：\n\n同一个人物\n同一张脸\n同一个动作\n同一个姿态\n同一个场景\n同一个拍摄角度\n同一个构图\n\n只做轻度调色，不改变原图内容。\n\n下半部分\n\n严格保持上半部分的：\n\n人物身份、面部特征、发型、服装、动作、姿态、主体位置、场景、机位和构图不变。\n\n只重新设计光线和影子。\n\n使用一个明确的硬质主光源，让人物在墙面、地面或背景表面形成清晰的大尺度投影。\n\n真实人物本身保持完全不变。\n\n但人物身后的影子，转化为：\n\n【未来的自己 / 动物 / 神话角色 / 建筑 / 植物 / 职业形象 / 产品结构】\n\n影子必须：\n\n从真实人物脚下或身体接触点自然产生\n符合真实光源方向\n符合透视关系\n保持明确轮廓\n与地面或墙面真实贴合\n具有自然的明暗衰减\n不能像后贴上去的图形\n\n最终效果必须像：\n\n真实人物站在那里，但投下的却是另一个身份的影子。\n\n禁止：\n\n换脸\n改动作\n改服装\n改人物比例\n生成第二个实体人物\n把影子做成漂浮图案\n使用霓虹描边\n做成插画贴纸\n出现错误光源方向\n🔁延伸玩法\n人物照\n\n最适合做：\n\n现在的我 × 未来的我\n\n比如：\n\n普通上班族，影子变成宇航员。\n学生，影子变成导演。\n普通街拍，影子变成超级英雄轮廓。\n\n旅行照\n\n人物站在景点前。\n\n影子可以变成：\n\n当地建筑、城市天际线、文化符号、动物图腾。\n\n宠物照\n\n真实宠物保持不变。\n\n影子可以变成：\n\n狮子、老虎、狼、巨型猫科动物。\n\n这种反差很容易出效果。\n\n产品照\n\n真实产品保持原样。\n\n影子可以直接变成：\n\n内部结构、原材料、品牌图形、使用场景。\n\n比如：\n\n香水瓶的影子变成一束花。\n相机的影子变成镜头结构。\n咖啡杯的影子变成咖啡树。\n\n上传一张普通照片，让AI不改你，只改你的影子。\n#HOW I AI##AI创造营##德里克文的ai学习笔记#","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSjK7YNaIAAgV9X.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSjK7YNagAAhM_h.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSjK7YTbwAAIzCG.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSjK7YNbUAAbV0N.jpg"]},{"i":19030,"text":"Hyper-realistic wildlife photograph. A young cheetah cub sitting in tall golden savannah grass at sunrise, enormous curious eyes looking directly at the camera, soft morning light glowing through its spotted fur. Soft warm golden light, shallow depth of field, gentle bokeh, innocent vulnerable energy. National Geographic grade, 4:5 vertical, 8k, no text.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSjhwS0acAAvnO0.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSjhwSmaAAA7AyE.jpg"]},{"i":19031,"text":"## [Subject Description]\n\nA photorealistic large group portrait of **many distinct young adult  women(20-28y)** arranged across a grand double staircase and the marble floor of an elegant mansion. Each woman has individually varied facial features, hairstyles, body proportions, expressions, and poses; preserve clear visual individuality rather than homogenizing their appearances.\n\nThey wear a wide variety of **two-piece bikinis in different colors, patterns, and designs**, including white, black, red, pink, blue, green, orange, and floral prints. Hairstyles vary naturally, including long straight hair, long wavy hair, medium-length hair, and bangs. Expressions are generally relaxed and friendly, with many women looking directly toward the camera.\n\nThe women are arranged in multiple vertical and horizontal tiers: standing along both staircases and upper balcony areas, standing and kneeling on the lower floor, and several seated or kneeling in the foreground. Poses remain natural and clearly readable, with complete bodies and limbs visible wherever possible.\n\nThey possess the best head-to-body ratio, a perfect, curvaceous, S-shaped female figure,Hourglass figure,long legs with perfect leg lines, and a slender waist, perfect foots,perfect foot lines\n\n## [Scene / Background]\n\nAn opulent **European-style luxury mansion foyer** with a dramatic symmetrical double staircase. The interior features cream and ivory architectural walls, elaborate classical molding, tall decorative columns, ornate black wrought-iron railings with intricate gold detailing, polished white marble flooring, and large arched windows.\n\nA large crystal chandelier hangs centrally above the staircase. Additional chandeliers and warm interior lighting are visible deeper in the mansion. The staircase curves upward symmetrically from both sides toward a central upper landing, creating a grand architectural frame around the group.\n\nThe background includes decorative balconies, classical wall panels, ornamental gold accents, elegant furniture, lamps, and a distant doorway/window visible beneath the central staircase.\n\n## [Lighting / Ambience]\n\nWarm, luxurious indoor illumination with soft golden ambient light. Crystal chandeliers produce subtle highlights and reflections across the polished marble floor and metal railings. Balanced exposure across the entire large group, with gentle soft shadows and natural skin tones.\n\nThe atmosphere is elegant, formal, glamorous, and celebratory while retaining the realism of a professionally photographed group event.\n\n## [Composition / View]\n\n**Very wide horizontal group portrait**, straight-on eye-level perspective, centered and highly symmetrical composition.\n\nUse the architectural symmetry of the double staircase as the primary framing element. The central staircase landing and chandelier form the visual axis, while the women create layered rows following the curves and levels of the architecture.\n\nInclude the entire width of the staircase and foyer, with the foreground group extending across the marble floor. Maintain clear separation between individuals and avoid excessive overlapping of faces, torsos, hands, or legs.\n\nShow the women at different elevations and depths to create strong visual layering while keeping faces recognizable and bodies naturally proportioned. Full-body framing for foreground subjects, with no unnecessary cropping of heads or major limbs.\n\nUltra-wide perspective appropriate for a very large group photograph, while keeping architectural lines natural and avoiding extreme fisheye distortion.\n\n## [Style Reference]\n\n**Photorealistic high-end professional group photography**, realistic East Asian adult women, natural facial diversity, realistic anatomy and body proportions, authentic skin texture, physically plausible hair and fabric, detailed bikini materials and patterns.\n\nLuxury editorial photography combined with an upscale formal group portrait aesthetic. Natural photographic depth, realistic perspective, subtle lens rendering, refined warm color grading, crisp architectural detail, and convincing spatial depth.\n\nNo illustration, no anime, no CGI appearance, no duplicated faces, no cloned bodies, no homogenized facial features.\n\n## [Image Quality Parameters]\n\nUltra-high-resolution, highly detailed, sharp focus across the large group, realistic skin pores and fine hair strands, accurate hands and fingers, natural body anatomy, detailed fabric and metallic textures, clean facial rendering, realistic marble reflections, precise architectural details, balanced exposure, high dynamic range, subtle professional lens characteristics, natural depth of field appropriate for a large group, minimal distortion, clean image structure, professional full-frame camera quality, **wide horizontal aspect ratio**.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSkB7qyboAAyi5y.jpg"]},{"i":19032,"text":"Your logo becomes the coastline of a luxury tropical island.\n\n[ Logo Series - Part 2 ]\n\nPrompt:\n\n{\n  \"prompt_name\": \"Aerial Island Logo Shape Generator\",\n  \"user_input_required\": {\n    \"input_type\": [\"company_name (text)\", \"logo_image (upload)\"],\n    \"instruction\": \"Provide only a company name OR upload a logo image. The system will auto-generate the rest of the scene.\"\n  },\n  \"scene\": {\n    \"subject\": \"A remote tropical island photographed from a direct top-down aerial drone perspective, with its coastline and landmass naturally contoured to replicate the silhouette of the provided company logo\",\n    \"shape_source\": \"{{company_logo_or_name_silhouette}}\",\n    \"shape_fidelity\": \"The island's outline must be instantly recognizable as the logo shape when viewed from above, while still appearing like a naturally formed landmass — no artificial or man-made geometry\"\n  },\n  \"environment\": {\n    \"vegetation\": \"Dense, lush tropical palm trees and greenery covering the interior of the island\",\n    \"shoreline\": \"Fine white sand beaches tracing the entire perimeter of the logo-shaped landmass\",\n    \"water\": {\n      \"inner_ring\": \"Shallow crystal-clear turquoise lagoon encircling the island\",\n      \"outer_ring\": \"Deep sapphire-blue open ocean with realistic wave patterns and natural foam texture\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"lighting\": {\n    \"type\": \"Warm golden-hour sunlight\",\n    \"effects\": [\"soft natural shadows\", \"cinematic highlights on water\", \"gentle lens glow at frame edge\"]\n  },\n  \"photography_style\": {\n    \"genre\": \"High-end luxury travel and real estate aerial photography\",\n    \"camera_angle\": \"Directly overhead (bird's eye / nadir view)\",\n    \"realism\": \"Ultra-photorealistic, natural, organic — must not look CGI or artificially rendered\",\n    \"resolution\": \"8K, hyper-detailed textures on water, sand, and foliage\"\n  },\n  \"exclusions\": [\n    \"no visible text or watermarks\",\n    \"no people\",\n    \"no buildings or man-made structures\",\n    \"no boats\"\n  ]\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTcItqfbsAAiViN.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTcItoZbQAEE_5c.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTcItokaUAAHz93.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTcItocbUAAuk5R.jpg"]},{"i":19033,"text":"A young adult woman with a natural realistic appearance and confident relaxed presence. Maintain realistic human anatomy, natural proportions and authentic skin texture.\n\nHAIR:\nShoulder-length to medium-length dark black-brown hair with soft natural volume. Hair is parted slightly off-center with loose face-framing strands around the cheeks. The rest of the hair falls naturally in soft loose waves with subtle curls toward the ends. Slightly tousled editorial texture rather than perfectly styled hair. Natural individual hair strands visible.\n\nOUTFIT:\nShe is wearing a deep burgundy / wine-red oversized button-up shirt made from soft lightweight cotton or cotton-poplin fabric.\n\nThe shirt has:\n\nrelaxed oversized fit\n\nlong sleeves\n\nclassic pointed collar\n\nfull-length front button placket\n\nsmall matching buttons\n\nnatural fabric folds and wrinkles\n\nslightly dropped shoulders\n\nrelaxed cuffs\n\nsingle rectangular chest pocket on the left side\n\nuntucked loose hem with part of the shirt naturally tucked behind the trousers\n\nPair the shirt with high-waisted ivory-white tailored trousers.\n\nThe trousers have:\n\nclean structured tailoring\n\nhigh-rise waist\n\nwide relaxed legs\n\nfront pleats\n\nbelt loops\n\nsubtle waistband construction\n\nnatural fabric creases\n\nslightly loose fit through the hips and thighs\n\nelegant minimal fashion-editorial appearance\n\nACCESSORIES:\nAdd small elegant metallic stud earrings.\n\nShe wears round vintage-inspired sunglasses with thin gold-metal frames and dark slightly reflective lenses.\n\nAdd a delicate metallic bracelet on the wrist.\n\nKeep accessories minimal, refined and realistic.\n\nMAKEUP & FACE:\nNatural polished editorial makeup.\n\nSoft even skin with visible realistic skin texture.\nSubtle warm complexion.\nLight natural foundation rather than heavy coverage.\nSoftly defined eyebrows.\nNeutral warm eyeshadow.\nSubtle eyeliner.\nNatural eyelashes.\nVery light contouring around the cheekbones.\nSoft natural blush.\nLips with muted rosy-red lipstick and a natural satin finish.\n\nDo not over-smooth the skin.\nDo not make the face plastic or overly airbrushed.\n\nPOSE:\nMain large portrait:\nThe woman stands in a relaxed three-quarter pose facing slightly toward the left side of the frame.\n\nHer head is turned slightly toward the left while her eyes look toward the left side through the sunglasses.\n\nHer right arm is bent upward with her right hand placed naturally behind the back/side of her hair near the ear, gently touching the hair.\n\nHer left arm hangs naturally downward with the left hand placed casually inside the trouser pocket.\n\nShoulders relaxed.\nElbows naturally bent.\nPosture confident but effortless.\nBody language should feel candid and editorial rather than posed.\n\nHer expression is calm and subtly confident with a soft natural smile.\n\nCOLLAGE COMPOSITION:\nCreate a sophisticated multi-frame fashion editorial collage.\n\nThe composition contains one large full-color main portrait occupying the right and central portion of the image.\n\nBehind and to the left of the main portrait, create multiple smaller photographic frames showing the same woman from slightly different moments of the same fashion shoot.\n\nUse approximately four smaller vertical/horizontal portrait panels stacked along the left side.\n\nThe smaller panels should be predominantly black-and-white / monochrome while the main central portrait remains in full natural color.\n\nEach smaller frame shows the same woman wearing the exact same outfit and sunglasses with subtly different but consistent poses and facial expressions.\n\nThe smaller images should feel like contact-sheet/editorial magazine photographs from the same photoshoot.\n\nUse thin clean white borders separating the panels.\n\nThe large color portrait should overlap the smaller monochrome photographs, creating a layered magazine-editorial collage.\n\nBACKGROUND:\nMinimal sophisticated studio environment.\n\nUse a warm neutral gray-beige studio wall with subtle smooth texture.\n\nNo distracting objects.\n\nBehind the subject, soft diagonal window-light shadows fall across the wall, creating elegant geometric shadow patterns.\n\nThe background should remain clean, modern and premium.\n\nLIGHTING:\nSoft natural window light coming from the upper-left/front-left direction.\n\nModerate directional sunlight filtered through a large window or sheer curtain.\n\nCreate soft diagonal architectural shadows across the neutral wall.\n\nLight the face naturally with gentle highlights on the cheeks, nose and forehead.\n\nMaintain subtle shadow definition under the jaw, hair and clothing folds.\n\nAvoid harsh flash.\nAvoid dramatic artificial rim lighting.\nAvoid overexposure.\n\nThe main color photograph should have warm natural skin tones while the smaller photographs use a sophisticated neutral monochrome treatment.\n\nCAMERA:\nProfessional editorial fashion photography.\n\nFull-frame camera look.\n50mm to 85mm portrait lens.\nEye-level camera angle.\nMedium-full portrait framing for the main image.\nNatural perspective with minimal distortion.\nModerately shallow depth of field.\nSubject sharply focused while the background remains softly separated.\n\nHigh-resolution realistic photographic detail.\nNatural optical rendering.\nSubtle professional film-like tonal response.\n\nVISUAL STYLE:\nLuxury contemporary fashion editorial.\nMinimalist magazine photography.\nSophisticated Pinterest-style fashion editorial collage.\nClean composition.\nElegant muted color palette.\nPhotorealistic skin.\nNatural fabric texture.\nRealistic hair strands.\nPremium commercial photography quality.\n\nThe final image should feel like a professionally art-directed fashion campaign rather than an AI-generated portrait.\n\nCOLOR PALETTE:\nDeep burgundy shirt.\nIvory-white trousers.\nWarm gray-beige background.\nGold metallic accessories.\nNatural warm skin tones.\nMuted monochrome photographs in the background.\n\nCOMPOSITION PRIORITY:\n\n1. Preserve facial identity from the reference.\n\n2. Maintain consistent person across every panel.\n\n3. Keep the main color portrait dominant.\n\n4. Keep monochrome supporting portraits on the left.\n\n5. Maintain the clean white panel borders.\n\n6. Preserve the diagonal window shadows.\n\n7. Keep the outfit and accessories consistent across all frames.\n\n8. Maintain realistic photographic anatomy and proportions.different person, altered identity, face redesign, changed facial structure, different nose, different eyes, different lips, different jawline, different skin tone, facial distortion, asymmetrical face, plastic skin, excessive beauty filter, over-smoothed skin, artificial skin texture, cartoon, anime, CGI, 3D render, illustration, doll face, unrealistic anatomy, malformed hands, extra fingers, missing fingers, fused fingers, duplicated limbs, extra arms, extra hands, warped body, distorted sunglasses, floating accessories, inconsistent clothing, different outfit between frames, different hairstyle between frames, random jewelry, excessive makeup, heavy contour, glossy plastic skin, unnatural smile, exaggerated body proportions, extreme body shape, low resolution, blurry face, soft face details, motion blur, oversharpening, harsh flash, blown highlights, crushed shadows, cluttered background, random objects, text, typography, watermark, logo, border distortion, incorrect collage layout, inconsistent person across panels","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSoat9mbkAE9v6n.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSoat9ja8AA0vwx.jpg"]},{"i":19034,"text":"🔥重磅：Qwen-Image-2.1 正式开源权重！\n\n7B 轻量模型，把文生图 + 图像编辑做成同一个模型，还原生出透明图，性价比拉满。\n\n核心亮点：\n🔹 7B 视觉生成组件（32 层 Single-Stream DiT），轻、快、便宜，多图输入推理大幅加速\n🔹生成 + 编辑统一：一张模型搞定文生图、改图、抠主体\n🔹原生 RGBA 透明图：直接出透明图层，也能编辑透明素材、做无缝合成\n🔹最多 10 张参考图：人物/商品保真强，适合合影、虚拟试穿、产品替换\n🔹局部精准控：圈选、涂抹、蒙版都能指定区域，一次改多处\n🔹美学升级：文字排版、人像光影、材质纹理更稳，也更适合全景、信息图、分镜\n🔹生态首日就位：Diffusers / ComfyUI / vLLM-Omni / SGLang 当天就能跑\n\n立刻上手：\nBlog：\nGitHub：\nHugging Face：\n\n#Qwen #QwenImage #开源 #AI绘画 #文生图 #图像编辑 #ComfyUI #AIGC​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​ #阿里巴巴","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSu67VCagAIVcZ0.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSu67USa0AADX1X.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSu67VCboAAcS_A.jpg"]},{"i":19035,"text":"Ultra realistic high fashion street editorial, young adult woman outside a classic European café beside a vintage powder blue Vespa style scooter with an oversized glossy canary yellow sidecar. Eccentric, glamorous, slightly surreal 1960s Italian fashion fantasy meets modern editorial. Sleek jet black center parted low bun. Porcelain skin, sharp brows, dramatic black eyeliner, vivid matte red lips, oversized white cat eye sunglasses with black lenses. Pale icy blue couture midi dress: dense 3D ruffles, shredded tulle, feather like petals, organza strips, dark embellishments, voluminous cloud like silhouette, dramatic neckline, exaggerated shoulders. Glossy emerald green structured handbag, yellow pointed toe stiletto pumps with black accents. Seated elegantly on sidecar edge, composed aloof expression, full body editorial pose. Café: dark wood frames, vintage red \"CAFE\" sign, gingham tablecloths, warm amber light. Weathered beige plaster wall beside it. Strong on camera flash, warm ambient light, film grain, saturated colors, vintage 35mm editorial aesthetic. Vertical 3:4 composition. Photorealistic, high resolution. Negative prompt: minimalist café, casual streetwear, soft studio lighting, plain dress, CGI, anime, cartoon, distorted anatomy, warped sidecar.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSqqiqjacAE8QlA.jpg"]},{"i":19036,"text":"concept for your next fashion post:  \n\nHigh-fashion streetwear influencer mirror selfie in a bright minimal apartment\n\n[ Portrait Series - Part 3 ]\n\nPrompt: \n\n{\n  \"prompt_type\": \"mirror_selfie_fashion_portrait\",\n  \"subject\": \"{{PERSON_NAME_OR_IMAGE}}\",\n  \"shot\": {\n    \"type\": \"full-length mirror selfie\",\n    \"framing\": \"head to mid-thigh, slightly angled, phone raised to chest/face height partially obscuring lower face\",\n    \"camera\": \"iPhone, held in raised hand, visible in reflection\",\n    \"angle\": \"slight 3/4 turn, weight shifted to one leg, one hand in trouser pocket\"\n  },\n  \"pose\": {\n    \"stance\": \"leaning shoulder against a white wall\",\n    \"free_hand\": \"tucked in trouser pocket\",\n    \"phone_hand\": \"raised near jaw/chest, holding phone up to take the mirror shot\",\n    \"expression\": \"relaxed half-smile or neutral confident look\"\n  },\n  \"outfit\": {\n    \"outerwear\": \"oversized black tailored blazer, single-breasted, sleeves slightly pushed/rolled\",\n    \"top\": \"light blue and white pinstripe button-down shirt, worn unbuttoned at collar (2-3 buttons open), untucked or loosely tucked\",\n    \"bottoms\": \"black wide-leg pleated tailored trousers\",\n    \"belt\": \"black leather belt with gold oval buckle\",\n    \"fit\": \"relaxed, oversized, streetwear-meets-tailoring silhouette\"\n  },\n  \"accessories\": {\n    \"eyewear\": \"black rectangular sunglasses\",\n    \"jewelry\": [\"gold or silver wristwatch\", \"layered rings\", \"thin gold chain necklace\", \"beaded or gold bracelet\"],\n    \"tattoos\": \"visible ink on chest, hand, and/or forearm\"\n  },\n  \"hair\": \"dark, tousled, voluminous wavy/curly hairstyle, slightly messy on top\",\n  \"setting\": {\n    \"location\": \"minimal home interior, floor-to-ceiling mirror\",\n    \"background\": \"plain white/off-white wall, open clothing rack with neutral-toned garments visible, wood or light flooring\",\n    \"props\": \"coffee mug or phone occasionally visible in background\"\n  },\n  \"lighting\": \"soft, even natural daylight, no harsh shadows, bright airy tone\",\n  \"color_palette\": \"neutral - black, white, light blue, warm skin tones, gold accents\",\n  \"style_reference\": \"high-fashion streetwear influencer OOTD mirror selfie, editorial minimalist aesthetic\",\n  \"aspect_ratio\": \"1:4\",\n  \"quality\": \"high resolution, sharp focus on subject, natural phone-camera grain\"\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSsAWeTaIAAicNS.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSsAWeXaUAAdKzO.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSsAWebaQAASy0r.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSsAWeRacAAmLGK.jpg"]},{"i":19037,"text":"就能让你身后多出一个“隐藏分身”。\n\n可以是半透明灵体。\n可以是巨大的动物轮廓。\n也可以是烟雾、花瓣、水流、数据颗粒组成的另一个你。\n\n最重要的是：\n\n原来的人和照片都不用改。\n\n你只需要上传照片，把下面的提示词直接复制给 GPT-Image-2，就能得到这种“现实人物 + 超现实伴生体”的效果。\n\n特别适合拿来做：\n\n人物写真、个人IP、情侣照、职业形象、游戏角色感人像。\n\n今天这条我直接把完整提示词给你：\n\n请基于我上传的一张人物照片，生成一张3:4竖版“上下双生海报”。\n\n整体上下两个区域严格1:1分割，各占画面50%。\n\n上半部分：\n保留原始照片的主体身份、五官、发型、服装、姿态、构图和环境关系，仅做轻微高级调色。\n保持真实摄影质感，不要改变人物，不要增加额外角色。\n\n下半部分：\n仍然基于同一张照片中的同一人物，保持人物身份、脸部特征、服装、姿态、机位和场景不变。\n在人物身后、侧后方或身体边缘，生成一个“灵体伴生体”。\n\n这个伴生体应当像人物隐藏气质、情绪或力量的具象化分身，\n由【烟雾 / 光线 / 墨迹 / 数据颗粒 / 水流 / 花瓣 / 火焰 / 透明能量 / 半透明动物轮廓】构成。\n伴生体必须与人物有明确关系，像从人物身上延伸、生长或浮现出来。\n\n要求：\n伴生体是画面的视觉重点之一，但不能遮挡人物主体识别。\n整体仍然保持高级、真实、具有电影感的摄影效果。\n不是恐怖鬼怪，不要血腥，不要怪兽化，不要二次元卡通，不要夸张游戏特效。\n下半部分要像“现实中真的拍到了另一个隐形的自己”。\n\n整体风格：\n上半现实纪实，下半现实摄影基础上的超现实伴生呈现。\n画面需要有清晰的上下反差，但仍属于同一套视觉系统。\n\n📌 一句话总结\n\n灵体伴生双生，不是简单换个画风，而是把同一个人看不见的那一面，变成一张真的能被拍到的照片。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HStVn5hbUAAK2r8.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HStVn5YaUAA6FTJ.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HStVn5abgAADxwJ.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HStVn5XbcAAKWpl.jpg"]},{"i":19038,"text":"技术\n\n自勉~\n\n本次提示词，图二的提示词：\n\n```\nA conceptual editorial specimen study of {SUBJECT}, presented as a poetic visual taxonomy. Only part of the subject is shown as highly detailed monochrome photography, while the missing portion is reconstructed through large untouched negative space and a fragile imperfect hand-drawn contour. Treat the object as both physical matter and an abstract idea. Sparse sensory words quietly annotate intangible qualities rather than literal anatomy. A few isolated square texture samples act as material evidence. Extreme white space, restrained asymmetrical composition, Swiss-inspired editorial typography, small bold lowercase grotesk labels, a thin marginal rule, tactile black-and-white photographic grain, subtle analog print imperfections. Scientific observation meets intimate poetry, precision meets human imperfection, presence meets absence. Quiet, cerebral, tender, archival, tactile, understated, museum-publication quality.\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSvSBWPakAET4d0.png","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSvSBZoacAAvBcY.jpg"]},{"i":19039,"text":"Create a 30-second ultra-realistic comedic live-action video, 16:9 horizontal, native 4K, 24fps.\nIMPORTANT ORIGINALITY:\nThis is a completely fictional comedy concept. Do not reference, imitate, reproduce, or visually resemble any real company, brand, advertisement, product, character, movie, television show, influencer, or existing commercial. Use entirely original packaging, dialogue, visual design, and presentation.\nCONCEPT:\nA fictional man in his early 30s performs an extremely serious unboxing of a mysterious new 2026 consumer product. He opens the box and discovers that the “product” is actually an adorable, realistic-looking AI-generated newborn baby. The humor comes from treating the baby like a brand-new technology product while maintaining realistic human behavior.\nCHARACTER:\nA fictional adult man in his early 30s with natural realistic human features, dark hair, casual modern clothing, realistic skin texture, natural facial expressions and believable body proportions.\nBABY:\nA completely fictional AI-generated newborn baby with realistic natural skin, subtle facial movements, natural blinking and gentle movements. The baby remains calm and comfortable. Whenever the man holds the baby, he supports the baby's head, neck and body properly with both arms. No dropping, shaking, rough handling, distress, or unsafe behavior.\nSETTING:\nAn original modern home studio with a clean table and neutral interior. No recognizable logos, trademarks, brand colors, or existing product designs.\nA completely fictional plain premium box sits on the table. The box has an original generic label:\n“2026”\n“NEW ARRIVAL”\nNo company name or recognizable logo.\n0–5 SECONDS:\nCinematic close-up of the mysterious box.\nThe man enters frame, looks directly into the camera and says excitedly:\n“Okay everyone… the new 2026 arrival is finally here!”\nHe dramatically places his hands on the box.\n5–10 SECONDS:\nHe slowly opens the box with exaggerated seriousness.\nHe looks inside.\nHis confident expression immediately turns into complete confusion.\nHe says:\n“Uh… this is definitely not what I ordered.”\nCamera cuts naturally between his confused face and the inside of the box.\n10–16 SECONDS:\nHe carefully and gently lifts the realistic baby from the box, properly supporting the baby's head and body.\nHe looks at the baby, then at the camera.\nWith a completely serious product-reviewer expression, he says:\n“First impression… very compact.”\nHe examines the baby briefly.\n“Extremely portable.”\nHe pauses.\n“And apparently… no instruction manual.”\n16–23 SECONDS:\nHe comfortably holds the baby in his arms while continuing the fake product review.\nHe says:\n“Let's check the features.”\nThe baby looks toward the camera.\n“Face recognition?”\nThe baby naturally looks at him.\n“Working perfectly.”\nThe baby makes a tiny natural movement.\n“Automatic sleep mode?”\nThe baby briefly closes its eyes.\nThe man nods seriously:\n“Excellent.”\n23–30 SECONDS:\nThe man looks directly at the camera.\n“And the battery life?”\nThe baby naturally yawns.\nThe man looks at the baby, then back at the camera.\nHe says:\n“Apparently… eighteen years.”\nBrief comedic pause.\nHe smiles:\n“Okay. That's a serious upgrade.”\nEnd with a natural cinematic shot of the man safely holding the baby while the open fictional box remains on the table in the background.\nVISUAL STYLE:\nExtremely photorealistic live-action appearance. Natural human skin texture, realistic hands and fingers, physically accurate lighting, realistic fabric movement, natural eye reflections, believable facial micro-expressions, realistic baby movements, cinematic depth of field, subtle camera movement, natural shadows, realistic indoor acoustics, clean dialogue recording and accurate lip synchronization.\nCOMEDY STYLE:","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2102046648507695104/img/42ruBaUujoatoEn8.jpg"]}];